t BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a workflowTasksCleaner namespace container (#9)\n\nMove the 2 root Query (workflowTasksCleanerConfig/WorkflowList) + 2 root Mutation\n(workflowTasksCleanerRunClean/SaveConfig) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace\ncontainer, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    workflowTasksCleanerConfig -> workflowTasksCleaner { config }, ...WorkflowList -> { workflowList }\n- Mutation: workflowTasksCleanerRunClean -> { runClean }, ...SaveConfig -> { saveConfig }\n\nNew holder types WorkflowTasksCleanerQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods; the *Extension classes keep a single workflowTasksCleaner accessor\nfield. @GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf. SaveConfigValidationTest repointed to\nthe instance method on the holder. Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixtures/specs updated\nin lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d764a901018f48b5e103f856c86e3e67d59515c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/git/trees/9d764a901018f48b5e103f856c86e3e67d59515c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/git/commits/df8605dc72841051e5921e265654b1590251e0c7","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d764a901018f48b5e103f856c86e3e67d59515c\nparent 2763cf4b6494383b49d064334371553aa6e96799\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782027001 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782027001 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a workflowTasksCleaner namespace container (#9)\n\nMove the 2 root Query (workflowTasksCleanerConfig/WorkflowList) + 2 root Mutation\n(workflowTasksCleanerRunClean/SaveConfig) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace\ncontainer, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    workflowTasksCleanerConfig -> workflowTasksCleaner { config }, ...WorkflowList -> { workflowList }\n- Mutation: workflowTasksCleanerRunClean -> { runClean }, ...SaveConfig -> { saveConfig }\n\nNew holder types WorkflowTasksCleanerQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods; the *Extension classes keep a single workflowTasksCleaner accessor\nfield. @GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf. SaveConfigValidationTest repointed to\nthe instance method on the holder. Frontend gql.js + jsx and Cypress fixtures/specs updated\nin lockstep.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqN5L5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoIYQAKCK2TWl4VMuzI6PQfWXbZ2Q\nN3z3SNqBEW0Vss5pU5IUJtoYovYjRrakSAOURZwNw/SntDdF+e2ICpXjEQyWsVZb\nyh2Cgy9C4rvhsGn0JMpLCF2Y3v/Jge13QAqEmYLcdOi3doK0NqaLiLhAydRd7GLz\ngSrawr/Kx8UX1D9/fjiRyQ7srcL/h4k15MTDTX5dG84ncTlHcL0hSeEgLlJLppwj\nFpDuLDRt3NX9Y8R9aCWNkOL69RTejTrhBIeeR4PHA5eDJI/Fj88oMsvJwGysoC4h\nsFbWn4AB4tk2HXJFu2H5UMf282hRlgYwSH8wrgjm5EvgtSo9WcXF0ZRNJMmlRLq9\n60Rup4qgHz9HpyX594brdNbhgCflt8fSZ+0RT0PiGF+Q9DkmD8VNJYot9ctHkfSG\nXWez5a6m6uzLnxqcZlpv8bZAp1+y7SMEi7cGYH9NOyPvWm+NVG65UrpaH5dQm6C/\nNBV9D5pZQ2cMlbB8Tewbd3/2Y1wJOMR2nCX/bvuOjbSP3XDGthDDui96EAINJQ6J\nVsz9aaEXP9j7x/q0szBtTl/+xvv36Mvm3vzYLZE7ccUxtzpS2RGWN87zLbSXVugA\nkPEoYxY/IqtWpYYuNKxxrke1pUUPKB3vSRqIpj7FrrW3+MMgAuFf//MxXPv/31f8\nxjQmE8fSsf/0saZ+t0yo\n=Xens\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-21T07:30:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/commit/df8605dc72841051e5921e265654b1590251e0c7","node_id":"C_kwDOH5oRtdoAKGRmODYwNWRjNzI4NDEwNTFlNTkyMWUyNjU2NTRiMTU5MDI1MWUwYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/commit/2763cf4b6494383b49d064334371553aa6e96799","sha":"2763cf4b6494383b49d064334371553aa6e96799","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/commits/2763cf4b6494383b49d064334371553aa6e96799"}],"sha":"df8605dc72841051e5921e265654b1590251e0c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/commits/df8605dc72841051e5921e265654b1590251e0c7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/commits/2763cf4b6494383b49d064334371553aa6e96799/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:31:25Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:31:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"workflow-tasks-cleaner: robustness fixes + first unit tests (#3)\n\n* fix: harden workflow-tasks-cleaner robustness + add first unit tests\n\nBug fixes:\n- Remove spurious Thread.currentThread().interrupt() from the reflection-error\n  catch blocks in WorkflowListCommand/WorkflowTaskCommand (the interrupt flag is\n  only meaningful for InterruptedException and could corrupt later blocking calls)\n- WorkflowListCommand: wrap the workflow-listing calls in try/finally so the jBPM\n  transaction is always ended even if a list call throws (was a transaction leak)\n- CleanCommand.cleanGhostWorkflows: guard the nodeIds cast with instanceof and\n  wrap per-task processing in try/catch so one malformed workflow no longer\n  aborts the whole scan\n\nMaintainability:\n- Extract DEFAULT_CRON_EXPRESSION constant (used by scheduler default + the\n  query-extension fallback) instead of duplicating the literal\n- Correct the saveConfig GraphQL description: the scheduler is @Modified, so the\n  job reschedules automatically on config update (no restart required)\n- Narrow an over-broad catch(Exception) to catch(IOException) in the config query\n\nTests (module previously had none): add JUnit4 + AssertJ tests for the\nWorkflowStatus enum lookups and the saveConfig cron-validation guard (22 tests).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* refactor: address PR review (narrow per-task catch, real-method validation test)\n\n- CleanCommand: narrow the per-task catch to RuntimeException so a checked\n  RepositoryException (dead JCR session) still propagates and aborts the batch,\n  while a single malformed task is skipped; drop the redundant method-level\n  @SuppressWarnings (the local-variable one covers the cast)\n- SaveConfigValidationTest: exercise the real saveConfig() for invalid inputs\n  (the guard returns false before any OSGi call) instead of a copied guard, and\n  assert valid expressions via CronExpression.isValidExpression — removes the\n  test-drift risk\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"76bb33639e553ba3633a8f4b2799853f7bc88fb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/git/trees/76bb33639e553ba3633a8f4b2799853f7bc88fb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/git/commits/2763cf4b6494383b49d064334371553aa6e96799","verification":{"payload":"tree 76bb33639e553ba3633a8f4b2799853f7bc88fb8\nparent 2d907f01c9140b5457fef1aee90fe189185ebc27\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781976685 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781976685 +0200\n\nworkflow-tasks-cleaner: robustness fixes + first unit tests (#3)\n\n* fix: harden workflow-tasks-cleaner robustness + add first unit tests\n\nBug fixes:\n- Remove spurious Thread.currentThread().interrupt() from the reflection-error\n  catch blocks in WorkflowListCommand/WorkflowTaskCommand (the interrupt flag is\n  only meaningful for InterruptedException and could corrupt later blocking calls)\n- WorkflowListCommand: wrap the workflow-listing calls in try/finally so the jBPM\n  transaction is always ended even if a list call throws (was a transaction leak)\n- CleanCommand.cleanGhostWorkflows: guard the nodeIds cast with instanceof and\n  wrap per-task processing in try/catch so one malformed workflow no longer\n  aborts the whole scan\n\nMaintainability:\n- Extract DEFAULT_CRON_EXPRESSION constant (used by scheduler default + the\n  query-extension fallback) instead of duplicating the literal\n- Correct the saveConfig GraphQL description: the scheduler is @Modified, so the\n  job reschedules automatically on config update (no restart required)\n- Narrow an over-broad catch(Exception) to catch(IOException) in the config query\n\nTests (module previously had none): add JUnit4 + AssertJ tests for the\nWorkflowStatus enum lookups and the saveConfig cron-validation guard (22 tests).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* refactor: address PR review (narrow per-task catch, real-method validation test)\n\n- CleanCommand: narrow the per-task catch to RuntimeException so a checked\n  RepositoryException (dead JCR session) still propagates and aborts the batch,\n  while a single malformed task is skipped; drop the redundant method-level\n  @SuppressWarnings (the local-variable one covers the cast)\n- SaveConfigValidationTest: exercise the real saveConfig() for invalid inputs\n  (the guard returns false before any OSGi call) instead of a copied guard, and\n  assert valid expressions via CronExpression.isValidExpression — removes the\n  test-drift risk\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNs5tCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAh+YQAAapklLK7iJ82/WUfdajbWlO\nFUaszSNRxEemShqSgfnH+fYJqYuER4aIBLFph1viIcePirBaSIc4d+4mzRyGoBMb\nbMw9gUaecy780xTrOCepYGiAVUY5tL89+FcS9k5w/GOKhJID8WkQxbtLfidtJVaN\ntwBFmW5tlzscordBPCaWeUXmBdpexoLsxCHdmDZFRM94darTYhWjGKmwr6MijK6B\nrpT4S+JrE19K7tHnBTduOV1NiVoZA+Q5itM2Nws5tAT9Kvh7LZQJgNo+0qlsrE2C\niJbrGGNtJBybXUumLJ1JaQjGH7twtgT6zz+unLfgaQsFQzI/ksBLf0wl+8vSTv77\nIniEzX9TuKhJCKYwroNFga1WqQeTMwvgY9+SspIJpKbtyRXnDCCu6fczz7tKXTff\n2id5ki8NWCj4pZX83fVa9hxM6adf5fpi5e+PFCmfM4v76SXIOTHoE7F21johNzft\nbZ13o36gRJuo57pvmemZ0DvxCkPnU5P3QVkrHsAxbzviLixYR8k9JFX80gbDvXzi\nvhZl4gJ66J+itmzCxal8ARTV4iETOUOG1KeDbanQIVcvD1X1whRSxY5t+jw7uBkZ\nWaTpuCR2TW6HfUCBPG5ePn4VkKPhiEw4cAhE3vfqEdpVyKl5W3DgintyYSvr0FeF\n1ySldbLBNBTHqqYnqXPB\n=3bl+\n-----END PGP