urasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/commits/6fb2091f52684f5d5d86257747b2746051b890c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:50:21Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T19:50:21Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(a11y): resolve WCAG 2.1 AA issues — CRIT-01 to CRIT-03, MAJ-01 to MAJ-07, MIN-02, MIN-08\n\nCRIT-01: table th font-size 0.6875rem → 0.75rem (legibility at uppercase scale)\nCRIT-02: split single dynamic-role live region into two fixed-role always-in-DOM\n  regions (role=status + role=alert) in both WorkflowTasksCleaner and SchedulerConfig;\n  remove liveRef focus call that was moving focus to a visually-hidden element (MIN-02)\nCRIT-03: switch Table from aria-label to aria-labelledby pointing to existing h3,\n  avoiding Moonstone child-forwarding uncertainty\nMAJ-01: hardcode #595959 for table-th, tooltip, and restart-hint text (was\n  var(--color-gray) whose runtime Moonstone value can be lighter than the 5.5:1 fallback)\nMAJ-02: hardcode #767676 for section and table-row borders (was var(--color-gray_light,\n  #dadada) = 1.47:1, fails SC 1.4.11)\nMAJ-03: SchedulerConfig document.title now uses label.scheduler.configTitle\n  (\"Scheduler Configuration\") instead of generic \"Configuration\"\nMAJ-04: add .wtc_container *:focus-visible module-level policy (2px accent outline)\nMAJ-05: convert .wtc_label label font-size from 14px to 0.875rem (SC 1.4.4)\nMAJ-06: add required + aria-required=\"true\" to cron Input (SC 3.3.2, 4.1.2)\nMAJ-07: add aria-invalid + conditional aria-describedby including wtc-cron-err span\n  on save failure (SC 3.3.1)\nMIN-08: SchedulerConfig h2 now uses label.scheduler.configTitle (\"Scheduler\n  Configuration\") instead of generic \"Configuration\"\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4a6373a6c0491b9d222fd71421d651d9cb5f3f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/git/trees/c4a6373a6c0491b9d222fd71421d651d9cb5f3f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/workflow-tasks-cleaner/git/commits/6fb2091f52684f5d5d86257747b2746051b890c3","verification":{"payload":"tree c4a6373a6c0491b9d222fd71421d651d9cb5f3f9\nparent 21ce3f09bfb206cb241c711505a5d7592826d4e8\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778874621 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778874621 +0200\n\nfix(a11y): resolve WCAG 2.1 AA issues — CRIT-01 to CRIT-03, MAJ-01 to MAJ-07, MIN-02, MIN-08\n\nCRIT-01: table th font-size 0.6875rem → 0.75rem (legibility at uppercase scale)\nCRIT-02: split single dynamic-role live region into two fixed-role always-in-DOM\n  regions (role=status + role=alert) in both WorkflowTasksCleaner and SchedulerConfig;\n  remove liveRef focus call that was moving focus to a visually-hidden element (MIN-02)\nCRIT-03: switch Table from aria-label to aria-labelledby pointing to existing h3,\n  avoiding Moonstone child-forwarding uncertainty\nMAJ-01: hardcode #595959 for table-th, tooltip, and restart-hint text (was\n  var(--color-gray) whose runtime Moonstone value can be lighter than the 5.5:1 fallback)\nMAJ-02: hardcode #767676 for section and table-row borders (was var(--color-gray_light,\n  #dadada) = 1.47:1, fails SC 1.4.11)\nMAJ-03: SchedulerConfig document.title now uses label.scheduler.configTitle\n  (\"Scheduler Configuration\") instead of generic \"Configuration\"\nMAJ-04: add .wtc_container *:focus-visible module-level policy (2px accent outline)\nMAJ-05: convert .wtc_label label font-size from 14px to 0.875rem (SC 1.4.4)\nMAJ-06: add required + aria-required=\"true\" to cron Input (SC 3.3.2, 4.1.2)\nMAJ-07: add aria-invalid + conditional aria-describedby including wtc-cron-err span\n  on save failure (SC 3.3.1)\nMIN-08: SchedulerConfig h2 now uses label.scheduler.configTitle (\"Scheduler\n  Configuration\") instead of generic \"Co