pos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/module-federation/vite/commit/2f2fb38a925fff6f3e4f713f4f91131d2e7a466c","node_id":"C_kwDOH9I6bdoAKDJmMmZiMzhhOTI1ZmZmNmYzZTRmNzEzZjRmOTExMzFkMmU3YTQ2NmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/module-federation/vite/commit/3e255c5c9a306fab6cfb00469b92e7f3fddebe83","sha":"3e255c5c9a306fab6cfb00469b92e7f3fddebe83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/module-federation/vite/commits/3e255c5c9a306fab6cfb00469b92e7f3fddebe83"}],"sha":"2f2fb38a925fff6f3e4f713f4f91131d2e7a466c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/module-federation/vite/commits/2f2fb38a925fff6f3e4f713f4f91131d2e7a466c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2244375?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gu-stav","id":2244375,"login":"gu-stav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDQzNzU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gu-stav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/module-federation/vite/commits/3e255c5c9a306fab6cfb00469b92e7f3fddebe83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:34:32Z","email":"gustav.hansen@sanity.io","name":"Gustav Hansen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T13:34:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve shared packages through runtime dependents (#1352)\n\nThe dependents walk used require.resolve to locate each dependent.\nESM-only packages without require or default exports, and packages\nwithout entry files, were skipped with their subtree. This forced\nfallback to an arbitrary pnpm store copy. The first declarer across\ndependencies and devDependencies also won, so tooling could beat the\ncopy imported through a runtime dependency.\n\nDependents are now located through node_modules at their real paths.\nRuntime dependencies are searched before devDependencies, level by\nlevel. Different versions among the closest dependents emit one warning\nso users can pin the package.","tree":{"sha":"cb3e1d494f8c80a39d375aae43fbda11272b2b09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/module-federation/vite/git/trees/cb3e1d494f8c80a39d375aae43fbda11272b2b09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/module-federation/vite/git/commits/3e255c5c9a306fab6cfb00469b92e7f3fddebe83","verification":{"payload":"tree cb3e1d494f8c80a39d375aae43fbda11272b2b09\nparent 11b02ce6e2bb819df88d496cf6828206e21d05ec\nauthor Gustav Hansen <gustav.hansen@sanity.io> 1790256872 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790256872 +0200\n\nfix: resolve shared packages through runtime dependents (#1352)\n\nThe dependents walk used require.resolve to locate each dependent.\nESM-only packages without require or default exports, and packages\nwithout entry files, were skipped with their subtree. This forced\nfallback to an arbitrary pnpm store copy. The first declarer across\ndependencies and devDependencies also won, so tooling could beat the\ncopy imported through a runtime dependency.\n\nDependents are now located through node_modules at their real paths.\nRuntime dependencies are searched before devDependencies, level by\nlevel. Different versions among the closest dependents emit one warning\nso users can pin the package.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtSboCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAL9QQAAduyHDKVzoT43gra2Ufc93t\nb0LDl5uy75nHUjCwGVVAzqL34GAy1cykmAAEr23dw92htYOtOXEotyz3kfA9TXwf\nH3awWhxq7TW1Q+wbzFfptCoY8QwhP05zGJTZpLLY5yOv3szgzet9PS4ciRM6Zl2v\n75NEA1LauiKPNN8vmz+uBDXyIvmejrFAaq6On7RB+3B3uXyxI+RoyOVy1ZcNI+Hd\nXMyhWBFptHvwHIng4uWeeL901bk13uv7YVpfTK13oXmEdZ9T2U545Vuqq36aeKWl\nnA8/J3tS82Uy+ygHy2/obCCN9+JdQAUy2wuOhoxcixfVEwfLrvu+IWS4Z3gXwI5+\njnoovwySwddlP8qIzStoq20FcwMzyl7FNEvzx3u6rOzLKD4cw9n3VK7neH1q2j7U\nlyTnZUo7tPZriwBR4axRZb3dWXvZS+l5ufIV0DGf5fwkhjKCm2hrG9VTds0Jty89\nbK7d8dmpng56ivHL+NjWxhGoxZe3jcb6l4Dl8+tH07afnVL5iC2KTRv09vvF1f3S\n/hEcDjV8bCC2T36pFPLGfssTHYf7jM++boubzrI4LR4kjnZsPjz0CFASq/SyLOKE\nY0Z27gbm2rQaLwcWxfIhNcAFnrh08PRQtkDnQzTqwWWneBeMibJ/3EOAg03elj+J\nIpqxiv5fQ4TAZNRwe7WU\n=QWXA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-24T13:34:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/module-federation/vite/commit/3