on/vite/commits/cef906f06d06b1510b4623907d3a87cdac23e09e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59516497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalphK66/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalphK66/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalphK66/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalphK66/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RalphK66","id":59516497,"login":"RalphK66","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NTE2NDk3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalphK66/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalphK66/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalphK66/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalphK66/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalphK66/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RalphK66","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/module-federation/vite/commits/24f95ffa197ba21a632daa6e527184c6a39dd070/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T15:16:04Z","email":"59516497+RalphK66@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ralph"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T15:16:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: defer shared bridging to getExposes to prevent init deadlock (#1325)\n\n* fix: defer shared bridging to getExposes to prevent init deadlock\n\nWhen a webpack host loads a Vite remote that shares the same React\nversion, a circular deadlock can occur: the host''s loadShare →\ninitializeSharing awaits the Vite remote''s init, but the remote''s\ninit eagerly runs __mfBridgeSharedProviders which calls loadShare\nback on the host, whose initializeSharing awaits the remote''s\nstill-pending init — a cycle that never resolves.\n\nThe __mfLateBridgeShared deferral mechanism already exists and runs\nin getExposes(), but was only assigned conditionally when\n__mfUsesWebpackShareScope was true. This change assigns it\nunconditionally, deferring both __mfBridgeSharedProviders and the\nglobal instances bridging to getExposes() where all remote inits\nhave already completed.\n\n* fix: avoid webpack host init deadlock\n\n* fix: skip seeding shares behind a pending webpack provider in dev\n\nSince #1275 a subpath share the host does not provide is seeded locally\nduring init(), which evaluates the package''s dev proxy before the late\nbridge runs. Dev proxies snapshot their exports, so the remote kept its\nown React copy under webpack/rspack hosts (hooks crash). Prod proxies\nrebind and are unchanged.\n\n* test(e2e): webpack and rspack hosts consuming the Vite dev remote\n\nGuards the remote init() deadlock (#1326, #1064) and single-React\nrendering with same-version shared React.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Ralph Kilian <ralph.kilian@forsta.com>\nCo-authored-by: gioboa <giorgiob.boa@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"4da159d1630a295ddc3bf347f86dc54d8a91514d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/module-federation/vite/git/trees/4da159d1630a295ddc3bf347f86dc54d8a91514d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/module-federation/vite/git/commits/24f95ffa197ba21a632daa6e527184c6a39dd070","verification":{"payload":"tree 4da159d1630a295ddc3bf347f86dc54d8a91514d\nparent 5242af51f6301cc34433f90fe1e45b6210e222c3\nauthor Ralph <59516497+RalphK66@users.noreply.github.com> 1789830964 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789830964 +0200\n\nfix: defer shared bridging to getExposes to prevent init deadlock (#1325)\n\n* fix: defer shared bridging to getExposes to prevent init deadlock\n\nWhen a webpack host loads a Vite remote that shares the same React\nversion, a circular deadlock can occur: the host''s loadShare →\ninitializeSharing awaits the Vite remote''s init, but the remote''s\ninit eagerly runs __mfBridgeSharedProviders which calls loadShare\nback on the host, whose initializeSharing awaits the remote''s\nstill-pending init — a cycle that never resolves.\n\nThe __mfLateBridgeShared deferral mechanism already exists and runs\nin getExposes(), but was only assigned conditionally when\n__mfUsesWebpackShareScope was true. This change assigns it\nunconditionally, deferring both __mfBridgeSharedProviders and the\nglobal instances bridging to getExposes() where all remote inits\nhave already completed.\n\n* fix: avoid webpack host init deadlock\n\n* fix: skip seeding shares behind a pending webpack provider in dev\n\nSince #1275 a subpath share the host does not provide is seeded locally\nduring init(), which evaluates the package''s dev proxy before the late\nbridge runs. Dev proxies snapshot their exports, so the remote kept its\nown React copy under webpack/rspack hosts (hooks crash). Prod proxies\nrebind and are unchanged.\n\n* test(e2e): webpack and rspack hosts consuming the Vite dev remote\n\nGuards the remote init() deadlock (#1326, #1064) and single-React\nrendering with same-version shared React.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Ralph Kilian <ralph.kilian@forsta.com>\nCo-authored-by: gioboa <giorgiob.boa@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrqc0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAm5oQAIFm6+o1agH70IUwrSU1rpYB\n3gdS2Dqbv6E875I5h5kI2/EDJPviNnsz7PVPO2UUuI6REWtpHrXP3G/n2+7tB1SG\nsyGjLQgQ6sn3NkhSpPXgE/0qKx0UdbNHhHUzO4HlrSFhXjpXvtrqFLjzWg4Ekpzw\nVQMzlonwkZkpBmNuYtJkDKqLauYHS2kR+4x5mNnxY8054gRym3OYlyS+35QN4k7i\nvOwo2ayx7n4ZJt+OlYmxgr/Ido69UMIr4aqN+iykqOUBTQoUHfa9PsEepqDnKeRO\ntf4OQBkgBmeLPgPonyRpCMm/E4lvoA5pUTpCESTR8SPnjMhFlTh3tVI5D5hXtNhn\n9pC8QEIFVgl5UToG58IewYYHw4uwey4TY12L8WSmHNSThF2jQTH4MZBSRgvwLARQ\n5dEgmc7tIWoBB11sfxpLM7+Ub6pzGrHtNMsgm6R8bNAIV9Tp3r2yNdvxwjt2vGKb\n5TtWZ523oGj1qxpJdASTy30QBYceLdBiJ/+tzllbtknObdwIdNOZMM65IwfCzfDf\n766v0C+5LUgaWY78z2IeouoFgsXGraNYG0OoTROiw4VxhP39b6XsTTPKSbVCN0yU\ng0nsSvtAFQBYXO3Uunb3OiW66RJ3U5Q4TId46O7e3NZ6UNP9tDKY6T3SeyIv8rOP\n83iLjIXGiSQNhn/8hP3J\n=KXoi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":tr