)\n\n* [FEAT] Update import map for ipcei avant\n\n* [BUILD] Update import maps to latest DEMF versions\n\nBumps core frontend dependencies across multiple environment import maps, including Vue/Vue Router/Vuetify and several DEMF microfrontends (auth, event-handler, sidebar, footer, data-discovery, mashups, datasources, flows, and custom operators). Also adds `single-spa-layout` to DME import maps and aligns version consistency between ipcei and non-ipcei configurations.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: robraccu <roberto.raccuglia@eng.it>","tree":{"sha":"e26812deb5a254624a4d624b45f046ab359782af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/git/trees/e26812deb5a254624a4d624b45f046ab359782af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/git/commits/522d440ea6c1fb91d4e42165d6029f5e4fe90c9b","verification":{"payload":"tree e26812deb5a254624a4d624b45f046ab359782af\nparent 0483c0f2af4e47924ed126cd835f69d265b9976b\nauthor Claudio Bellanti <72557566+xClaudi0@users.noreply.github.com> 1785752426 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785752426 +0200\n\n[FEAT] Update import map for ipcei avant (#422)\n\n* [FEAT] Update import map for ipcei avant\n\n* [BUILD] Update import maps to latest DEMF versions\n\nBumps core frontend dependencies across multiple environment import maps, including Vue/Vue Router/Vuetify and several DEMF microfrontends (auth, event-handler, sidebar, footer, data-discovery, mashups, datasources, flows, and custom operators). Also adds `single-spa-layout` to DME import maps and aligns version consistency between ipcei and non-ipcei configurations.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: robraccu <roberto.raccuglia@eng.it>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcGtqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX44QAIvEqc3/vHhtn+AS9DCGMxEP\nG84Zy5To+IN6QXx2Pc5uTDNBpjyYU1KL8q9CuXpaKJsAsRtykK4z1SvfJsjCaayu\nEk6LlHneGbh9vHT/6QlIj7WmsIil6GnftWEWbwU0HZL8k35x6QkgwIztMWYoeFkH\nQmSe1psuMZQLRpB8M4bkAU7ti/XTOKuYOi45eqHEhtM