low","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/commit/9fb34fc4e574896ed7d9da420acd9bd6744e267c","node_id":"C_kwDOH9eFvNoAKDlmYjM0ZmM0ZTU3NDg5NmVkN2Q5ZGE0MjBhY2Q5YmQ2NzQ0ZTI2N2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/commit/ef04c6921ac33632e26df3eec685fd553b77afc8","sha":"ef04c6921ac33632e26df3eec685fd553b77afc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/commits/ef04c6921ac33632e26df3eec685fd553b77afc8"}],"sha":"9fb34fc4e574896ed7d9da420acd9bd6744e267c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/commits/9fb34fc4e574896ed7d9da420acd9bd6744e267c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5311201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robraccu","id":5311201,"login":"robraccu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTEyMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/commits/ef04c6921ac33632e26df3eec685fd553b77afc8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T10:17:30Z","email":"roberto.raccuglia@eng.it","name":"Roberto Raccuglia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T10:17:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Update discovery API endpoints and DD version (#407)\n\n* Update discovery API endpoints and DD version\n\nSwitch Data Discovery-related API URLs from dme-api to discovery-api in Avant and Regions4Climate DD configs, including auth, sidebar, and event handler settings. Also bump `demf-data-discovery` to `3.1.3` across DD/DME import maps for Avant, Regions4Climate, Citrace, and Mediren, and remove the obsolete Keycloak block from Avant DD auth config.\n\n* Fix sidebar logo asset paths\n\nUpdate sidebar configs across multiple microfrontends to use the correct module-specific logo paths for DD and DME, and point all mini logos to the shared `/commons/de-mini.svg` asset. This aligns branding asset references and avoids broken logo paths.\n\n* Update dd-import-map.json","tree":{"sha":"ff498aa341a6c74f50e32d247dbb416a34f02e39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/git/trees/ff498aa341a6c74f50e32d247dbb416a34f02e39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/git/commits/ef04c6921ac33632e26df3eec685fd553b77afc8","verification":{"payload":"tree ff498aa341a6c74f50e32d247dbb416a34f02e39\nparent 54bed7cde4d83d7e5681b45a0db7521ef70782f0\nauthor Roberto Raccuglia <roberto.raccuglia@eng.it> 1782814650 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782814650 +0200\n\nUpdate discovery API endpoints and DD version (#407)\n\n* Update discovery API endpoints and DD version\n\nSwitch Data Discovery-related API URLs from dme-api to discovery-api in Avant and Regions4Climate DD configs, including auth, sidebar, and event handler settings. Also bump `demf-data-discovery` to `3.1.3` across DD/DME import maps for Avant, Regions4Climate, Citrace, and Mediren, and remove the obsolete Keycloak block from Avant DD auth config.\n\n* Fix sidebar logo asset paths\n\nUpdate sidebar configs across multiple microfrontends to use the correct module-specific logo paths for DD and DME, and point all mini logos to the shared `/commons/de-mini.svg` asset. This aligns branding asset referen