, demf-event-handler 3.1.1→3.1.2, demf-sidebar 3.1.1→3.1.2, demf-footer 3.1.2→3.1.3, demf-dtm-* 3.0.0→3.0.1). Also standardize the demf-gui-root URL for mf-mediren to https://dtmui.avant.digital-enabler.eng.it/demf-dtm-gui.js.\n\n* [BUILD] Update DME import maps to newer package versions\n\nBump CDN package versions in multiple dme-import-map.json files (mf-avant, mf-regions4climate and temp copies). Notable updates: vue -> 3.5.33, vue-router -> 5.0.6, vuetify -> 3.12.5 and several demf-* packages moved to 3.1.x or 4.x series (including demf-auth, demf-event-handler, demf-sidebar, demf-footer, demf-mashups-*, demf-datasources-*, demf-flow-editor etc.). Also removed demf-share-form from mf-avant import map. These changes keep import maps aligned with newer runtime/library releases across environments.","tree":{"sha":"48869433f98d9be3de4a597e4ec34b0678c12ac6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/git/trees/48869433f98d9be3de4a597e4ec34b0678c12ac6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/git/commits/435920a19d85954e947dfd32cc618c4252870105","verification":{"payload":"tree 48869433f98d9be3de4a597e4ec34b0678c12ac6\nparent 6d4b049fddb063764b7fbe502367e5a6faf6aa5c\nauthor Roberto Raccuglia <roberto.raccuglia@eng.it> 1780645181 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780645181 +0200\n\nUpdate dtm (#400)\n\n* Bump demf packages and update import maps\n\nUpdate import maps for mf-avant, mf-mediren, and temp/mf-avant: bump demf package versions (demf-auth 3.1.2→3.1.3, demf-event-handler 3.1.1→3.1.2, demf-sidebar 3.1.1→3.1.2, demf-footer 3.1.2→3.1.3, demf-dtm-* 3.0.0→3.0.1). Also standardize the demf-gui-root URL for mf-mediren to https://dtmui.avant.digital-enabler.eng.it/demf-dtm-gui.js.\n\n* [BUILD] Update DME import maps to newer package versions\n\nBump CDN package versions in multiple dme-import-map.json files (mf-avant, mf-regions4climate and temp copies). Notable updates: vue -> 3.5.33, vue-router -> 5.0.6, vuetify 