ndler, models-list, sidebar) to register the Digital Twin Modeller microfrontends and local dev API endpoints. Also remove the keycloak block from temp/mf-avant/rm/rm-sidebar-config.json.","tree":{"sha":"1795019a6a21abaffb3d9feb44c14651d6b54444","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/git/trees/1795019a6a21abaffb3d9feb44c14651d6b54444"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/git/commits/1ea7cb91742437a7ffdb842b2e875f5ded32ba00","verification":{"payload":"tree 1795019a6a21abaffb3d9feb44c14651d6b54444\nparent d72539771fbd1e480ab7c8678f79d5c4b02bac7c\nauthor Roberto Raccuglia <roberto.raccuglia@eng.it> 1777972087 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777972087 +0200\n\nUpdate import-maps and add DTM configs (#383)\n\nBump shared import-map entries (demf-auth to 3.1.2, demf-event-handler to 3.1.1, demf-sidebar to 3.1.1, demf-footer to 3.1.2) and update Vue/Vue-Router/Vuetify versions across affected import-map files. Upgrade KPIM and RM microfrontend package versions in their import-maps. Add a new set of DTM configuration files and a dtm import-map under temp/mf-avant/dtm (includes auth, editor, conversion, data-binding, definition, summary, entities-list, entity, event-handler, models-list, sidebar) to register the Digital Twin Modeller microfrontends and local dev API endpoints. Also remove the keycloak block from temp/mf-avant/rm/rm-sidebar-config.json.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp+bN3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGT8QAFgWU5NlTZ3J1TC9PuENDejh\nVBGvcvesoc0fSy7GXiOF9pQblvXYXklGHqyve1z6Hg8rp5PZAqsl6QfnpZotgt1Z\nrTIx9mK2oTNopfFpNd06Zg4BrQXktW1d/AJ/T43HiBAd3PB9eha1as7IOThj2fzG\nnFKJ9L/i75S0oji8U6grlATFeaBTlLqRjB9NY7V8qw3H7FfIjXCaKvHOlPvc49Wc\niaQ53mO/oCkZ5MpOEzWxz7F3J3RVZurijFdFrCwMlMnC4y23fKBs0pcp0dGjYiXq\n0Po+ki+ZSKJ3PtzIc3kakyWUK6hpvpgcbARdZmidAuEc9YO9p6HIOY5BGZU6chqx\nALjdctq5b7xmFCvz86SdTZeSqp74QB8ByMXaUyYhokyBzq6g1ChNwO82sYS3I7yC\nW6h6Iy2AyLYfJ4EbWbnRN1H548Kc++zl4KbLsU+pAWa