ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/robraccu","id":5311201,"login":"robraccu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMTEyMDE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robraccu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/commits/d72539771fbd1e480ab7c8678f79d5c4b02bac7c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-04T10:17:56Z","email":"roberto.raccuglia@eng.it","name":"Roberto Raccuglia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-04T10:17:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Updates (#382)\n\n* [FEAT] Add mf-avant/dd microfrontend config files\n\nAdd configuration JSONs for the mf-avant/dd microfrontends and matching temp copies. Files added: dd-auth-config.json (Auth settings with Keycloak disabled), dd-data-discovery-config.json (Data Discovery settings including fileFormats and searchTimeout), dd-event-handler-config.json (Event Handler API), dd-import-map.json (CDN import map for single-spa, Vue, Vuetify and demf packages), and dd-sidebar-config.json (Sidebar links, assets and feature flags). These provide local/dev endpoints and CDN references for bootstrapping the Data Discovery feature.\n\n* Bump demf-mashups-editor to v3.2.2\n\nUpdate import maps to reference demf-mashups-editor@3.2.2 (from 3.2.1) across mf-avant/dme, mf-mediren/dme, and temp/mf-avant/dme so the apps use the latest patch release.\n\n* Update mf-avant DD/DME configs & imports\n\nAdd dd section to mf-avant config and switch Data Discovery/Auth/Event Handler/Sidebar APIs from localhost to production endpoints. Enable sidebar favorites, update jsonTools and logo paths, and adjust sidebar storage/img settings. Bump CDN package versions in dd and dme import maps (vue, vue-router, vuetify and several demf-* packages) and set DME data-discovery standaloneMode to false. These changes point the microfrontends to the deployed services and pull updated frontend dependencies.\n\n* Add Data Discovery (dd) microfrontend configs\n\nRegister and configure the Data Discovery microfrontends. Updated mf-regions4climate/config.json to add a dd section and added new files under mf-regions4climate/dd: dd-auth-config.json (auth/keycloak/api), dd-event-handler-config.json (event handler API), dd-data-discovery-config.json (api, standaloneMode, file format icons and searchTimeout), dd-sidebar-config.json (sidebar links, logos, storage and favorites), and dd-import-map.json (import map entries for required libs and microfrontends). These changes integrate the Data Discovery feature and its dependencies into the regions4climate app.\n\n* Update palettes and DME import types\n\nAdjust theme palettes across microfrontends and extend DME import options. Updated primary (#003050 → #002F53) and secondary (#C8004B → #C5004B) colors and added grey (#F3F4F6) to palettes in mf-avant, mf-citrace, mf-evita, mf-mediren, mf-mescobrad, mf-regions4climate, mf-urbreath and temp/mf-avant. Added importFileType entries for json (\".json\") and text (\".txt\") in dme-mashups-editor-config.json for mf-avant, mf-mediren, mf-regions4climate and temp/mf-avant. Also normalized JSON formatting in some config files (mf-evita, mf-mescobrad) and ensured EOF newline where needed.","tree":{"sha":"5871c5d761436b53fb0fe671256d3f2197772286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/git/trees/5871c5d761436b53fb0fe671256d3f2197772286"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/digital-enabler/UI-Configs/git/commits/d72539771fbd1e480ab7c8678f79d5c4b02bac7c","verification":{"payload":"tree 5871c5d761436b53fb0fe671256d3f2197772286\nparent 4626048342b669b8013b96372cfad4ba5e24be65\nauthor Roberto Raccuglia <roberto.raccuglia@eng.it> 1777889876 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777889876 +0200\n\nUpdates (#382)\n\n* [FEAT] Add mf-avant/dd microfrontend config files\n\nAdd configuration JSONs for the mf-avant/dd microfrontends and matching temp copies. Files added: dd-auth-config.json (Auth settings with Keycloak disabled), dd-data-discovery-config.json (Data Discovery settings including fileFormats and searchTimeout), dd-event-handler-config.json (Event Handler API), dd-import-map.json (CDN import map for single-spa, Vue, Vuetify and demf packages), and dd-sidebar-config.json (Sidebar links, assets and feature flags). These provide local/dev endpoints and CDN references for bootstrapping the Data Discovery feature.\n\n* Bump demf-mashups-editor to v3.2.2\n\nUpdate import maps to reference demf-mashups-editor@3.2.2 (from 3.2.1) across mf-avant/dme, mf-mediren/dme, and temp/mf-avant/dme so the apps use the latest patch release.\n\n* Update mf-avant DD/DME configs & imports\n\nAdd dd section to mf-avant config and switch Data Discovery/Auth/Event Handler/Sidebar APIs from localhost to production endpoints. Enable sidebar favorites, update jsonTools and logo paths, and adjust sidebar storage/img settings. Bump CDN package versions in dd and dme import maps (vue, vue-router, vuetify and several demf-* packages) and set DME data-discovery standaloneMode to false. These changes point the microfrontends to the deployed services and pull updated frontend dependencies.\n\n* Add Data Discovery (dd) microfrontend configs\n\nRegister and configure the Data Discovery microfrontends. Updated mf-regions4climate/config.json to add a dd section and added new files under mf-regions4climate/dd: dd-auth-config.json (auth/keycloak/api), dd-event-handler-config.json (event handler API), dd-data-discovery-config.json (api, standaloneMode, file format icons and searchTimeout), dd-sidebar-config.json (sidebar links, logos, storage and favorites), and dd-import-map.json (import map entries for required libs and microfrontends). These changes integrate the Data Discovery feature and its dependencies into the regions4climate app.\n\n* Update palettes and DME import types\n\nAdjust theme palettes across microfrontends and extend DME import options. Updated primary (#003050 → #002F53) and secondary (#C8004B → #C5004B) colors and added grey (#F3F4F6) to palettes in mf-avant, mf-citrace, mf-evita, mf-mediren, mf-mescobrad, mf-regions4climate, mf-urbreath and temp/mf-avant. Added importFileType entries for json (\".json\") and text (\".txt\") in dme-mashups-editor-config.json for mf-avant, mf-mediren, mf-regions4climate and temp/mf-avant. Also normalized JSON formatting in some config files (mf-evita, mf-mescobrad) and ensured EOF newline where needed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp+HJUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtUYQAAfcbN9IB0+5KVwR9Ii0EUv5\n0Xfajea3TPRVmdI8CTnPCJ7IdNRhY+QnfmDJFmAOl9e3CWCkpnMYgG659cG3ovfx\nhO5DKzECwRnBjJbFQw7izBJCaUmNuWs8MKp4Nch4Xh+f2iroH4FP8aHyQBb4tLJ+\n82FuOlQ5P7IrWuDKantIp/BwN7IiL5qg9asrY+JBAaGDNRbtmPvXJnjsEQti//sW\nKODxNXcaoy5XCOqtkjV5Lp26YC8uxvA9+FZmQZ8KrUsTQ8MQX1Ns6SVPu76So7Ff\nVv7MEvmY5yjXxlzBSw6emXsjtW6SCm8Tha5aJ+Qn63B3zTBO6zdOgCEy6GP4eIs6\nNemoAEtPF6B7cBNggMwmg0AImKcQ5jtFO2WNrAYPi38bSy+nLmgbLC4f2nhkFdOw\nuwt8JJjmiCIQOno9+YRjIgjxJ1r83mVQSAJu8DOvIc7faGHhKCMYOXe7SSPPIqkw\nxZBEYxeMWtzR2vmA1zEHAO/acc00UK68VjogSFXQz18NVkz/2woGIpktpbhZTR1c\nc125FQkqn8/iqoIvw15lyjvUNjo46deGi8DbQfel6y/n7GkHufcqrgk72b+heg9R\nD3zh1Md+8ErHekD06Lvwp8T1qPdoNldmWKfBk4jO3lheJrZaTwOfV4s/46kJnQBT\ndrjoCooad6kSXIQjqwko\n=/lD/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-0