s/furystack/pi-rat/commits/d00a39eb70ea10bdf20c348a4d0420ae93ad6336/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T16:51:44Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T16:51:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Chore/dependency updates 2026 04 24 (#128)\n\n## 📦 Summary\n\nRoutine dependency-maintenance sweep plus the code migrations required\nby the majors in the FuryStack stack.\n\n## ⬆️ Dependency Highlights\n\n- `@furystack/rest` 8 → 9, `@furystack/rest-service` 12 → 13\n- `@furystack/shades` 13 → 14, `@furystack/shades-common-components` 15\n→ 16\n- `@furystack/shades-lottie` 9 → 10, `@furystack/shades-mfe` 3 → 4\n- `@codecov/vite-plugin` 1 → 2\n- Yarn 4.13.0 → 4.14.1, TypeScript 6.0.3, Vite 8.0.10, Vitest 4.1.5,\nESLint 10.2.1, Prettier 3.8.3, Playwright 1.59.1, typescript-eslint\n8.59.0\n\n## 🔧 Migration Changes\n\n- **service:** `setupIdentityRestApi` replaces the removed `LoginAction`\nwith `createPasswordLoginAction(createCookieLoginStrategy(injector))`.\n- **frontend routing:** `routes/index.ts` now uses `defineNestedRoutes`\nplus the upstream `createNestedRouteLink<typeof appRoutes & typeof\nauthRoutes>()` and `createAppBarLink<...>()` factories; the legacy `as\nunknown as` wrappers and locally-duplicated `ExtractRoutePaths` are\ngone.\n- **frontend callsites:** every `<AppLink href=\"…\" />`, `<AppBarAppLink\nhref=\"…\" />`, and `<NestedRouteLink href=\"…\" />` renamed to `path` per\nthe shades 14 / shades-common-components 16 breaking change.\n- **lint fallout:** `typescript-eslint` 8.59 removed 17 redundant casts\nacross the repo; the two cases that then tripped\n`prefer-promise-reject-errors` (`execFileAsync`, drives `UploadAction`)\nnow always reject with an `Error` instance.","tree":{"sha":"c8f9157a0ddd09e601b4c8670c9f2f6f485598bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/trees/c8f9157a0ddd09e601b4c8670c9f2f6f485598bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/commits/d00a39eb70ea10bdf20c348a4d0420ae93ad6336","verification":{"payload":"tree c8f9157a0ddd09e601b4c8670c9f2f6f485598bc\nparent e94ce38c6d3b83b42abcabc689b398e5529aa1fd\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1777135904 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777135904 +0000\n\nChore/dependency updates 2026 04 24 (#128)\n\n## 📦 Summary\n\nRoutine dependency-maintenance sweep plus the code migrations required\nby the majors in the FuryStack stack.\n\n## ⬆️ Dependency Highlights\n\n- `@furystack/rest` 8 → 9, `@furystack/rest-service` 12 → 13\n- `@furystack/shades` 13 → 14, `@furystack/shades-common-components` 15\n→ 16\n- `@furystack/shades-lottie` 9 → 10, `@furystack/shades-mfe` 3 → 4\n- `@codecov/vite-plugin` 1 → 2\n- Yarn 4.13.0 → 4.14.1, TypeScript 6.0.3, Vite 8.0.10, Vitest 4.1.5,\nESLint 10.2.1, Prettier 3.8.3, Playwright 1.59.1, typescript-eslint\n8.59.0\n\n## 🔧 Migration Changes\n\n- **service:** `setupIdentityRestApi` replaces the removed `LoginAction`\nwith `createPasswordLoginAction(createCookieLoginStrategy(injector))`.\n- **frontend routing:** `routes/index.ts` now uses `defineNestedRoutes`\nplus the upstream `createNestedRouteLink<typeof appRoutes & typeof\nauthRoutes>()` and `createAppBarLink<...>()` factories; the legacy `as\nunknown as` wrappers and locally-duplicated `ExtractRoutePaths` are\ngone.\n- **frontend callsites:** every `<AppLink href=\"…\" />`, `<AppBarAppLink\nhref=\"…\" />`, and `<NestedRouteLink href=\"…\" />` renamed to `path` per\nthe shades 14 / shades-common-components 16 breaking change.\n- **lint fallout:** `typescript-eslint` 8.59 removed 17 redundant casts\nacross the repo; the two cases that then tripped\n`prefer-promise-reject-errors` (`execFileAsync`, drives `UploadAction`)\nnow always reject with an `Error` instance.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp7PEgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA99gQABrO7l3xhp5TUqHlHt5rviyQ\n7eOH4LhpOcRw/8anXvGLGAe1Neg