ate":"2026-03-10T16:52:37Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-10T16:52:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Chore/furystack upgrades (#125)\n\n## ⬆️ FuryStack Dependency Upgrades\n\nUpgrades all FuryStack dependencies to latest versions, including two\nmajor bumps:\n- `@furystack/core` ^15.2.5 → ^16.0.0\n- `@furystack/shades-common-components` ^14.0.0 → ^15.0.0\n\nAdapts authorization test files to the new `@furystack/core` v16 inject\nAPI where `IdentityContext` is now directly constructed and\n`setExplicitInstance` requires the constructor as a type token.\n\n## 📦 Updated Dependencies\n\n| Package | Notable Changes |\n|---------|----------------|\n| `common` | core v16, entity-sync, rest, @types/node |\n| `frontend` | core v16, shades v13.1, shades-common-components v15, +\nothers |\n| `service` | core v16, repository, rest-service, security,\nsequelize-store, websocket-api |\n| `pi-rat` (root) | eslint-plugin, lint-staged, typescript-eslint,\n@types/node |","tree":{"sha":"f38814c8ef0f25def890966ff28ca92c8e30649e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/trees/f38814c8ef0f25def890966ff28ca92c8e30649e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/commits/967af2bdd2b10343acda7640cf8f7b2943dbbfbb","verification":{"payload":"tree f38814c8ef0f25def890966ff28ca92c8e30649e\nparent f1e38effdb93b0d6e24cd3655bb00e139089c732\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1773161557 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773161557 +0100\n\nChore/furystack upgrades (#125)\n\n## ⬆️ FuryStack Dependency Upgrades\n\nUpgrades all FuryStack dependencies to latest versions, including two\nmajor bumps:\n- `@furystack/core` ^15.2.5 → ^16.0.0\n- `@furystack/shades-common-components` ^14.0.0 → ^15.0.0\n\nAdapts authorization test files to the new `@furystack/core` v16 inject\nAPI where `IdentityContext` is now directly constructed and\n`setExplicitInstance` requires the constructor as a type token.\n\n## 📦 Updated Dependencies\n\n| Package | Notable Changes |\n|---------|----------------|\n| `common` | core v16, entity-sync, rest, @types/node |\n| `frontend` | core v16, shades v13.1, shades-common-components v15, +\nothers |\n| `service` | core v16, repository, rest-service, security,\nsequelize-store, websocket-api |\n| `pi-rat` (root) | eslint-plugin, lint-staged, typescript-eslint,\n@types/node |","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpsExWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6QYQAAI3IyMvFRPaV1ixRZC8bwo2\nets6ojcVuAmw2mXS61/ljgz70nbB1VUddg3icPUxOyZ0Sx23RZN4grvr8HiybEEo\nyChxwUWE6h9hhwGJ+9fTmfLRxEQ9WXgdv3MLRp1lGJ1DT/Gszp4G7l/aHHxjfEVk\nxkBZJTxccHv6/9BJOXnEu8AuR7fZ+5t7KjU4yN+QT//DLDL5FTecPf/94TyEraXo\nRvSmwVpFKk1zT/ZmtzZURn7uevOAZpSM/oMZdcNJ1TjcO+p6ETn9xm4uG1OCqmHg\n9VFKvyN5dumH4UnfeyPvecs+sCBpLbb19xUkBt2rL3G37lGVXIjQzUORMfONW4a+\nf/H3JcLf423zIlgFa0FKRpSFlwRSBAW3yfYn85JgEwcHhqSMaFP0rJ3XiBRm0bRT\n8HQNABI2u0WBMA2a5l9jg8a+mxiyjOCqhZq6FQd9n1e3v4SyL+kSZ91zc34Xcp6X\nSgJ09gF+FLG/WTVGQ/O6uXxEIQ9qipC4r7sdK4UkHIT9aS4XI6mBG3Mx/PNS1zGn\n7ZMz4PPi8IqSAKHg2xcl9VTGo3M7LrNaqn+JYbBSSXFFSEpGc4UeRTXJCyYrksWO\njDJZMfCOutlWwb7I+49s9xI+BlwYDu2mmT5df63djhvKaqu2FLCcqxs4CqVfTXdG\nHHxWb2mDeCvspKp11q4C\n=wZR9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-10T16:52:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_ur