criptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/pi-rat/commit/8dd8230c08455db42d3c95d42ea24ef138cceaf2","node_id":"C_kwDOH9jGgNoAKDhkZDgyMzBjMDg0NTVkYjQyZDNjOTVkNDJlYTI0ZWYxMzhjY2VhZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/pi-rat/commit/3892f413002cef9b404d7a6af51c47a8d33e1649","sha":"3892f413002cef9b404d7a6af51c47a8d33e1649","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/3892f413002cef9b404d7a6af51c47a8d33e1649"}],"sha":"8dd8230c08455db42d3c95d42ea24ef138cceaf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/8dd8230c08455db42d3c95d42ea24ef138cceaf2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16716099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/3892f413002cef9b404d7a6af51c47a8d33e1649/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T13:04:10Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T13:04:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Layout rewamp (#122)\n\n## 🎨 Layout Revamp\n\nRefactors the frontend layout with modular routing, a redesigned login\npage, and unified error handling.\n\n### ✨ Features\n- **Login redesign** – Modern card layout with glassmorphism backdrop,\nentry animation, and inline error display\n- **PiRatLogo component** – SVG pirate-rat logo replacing the emoji in\nthe header\n- **RouteIndexPage** – Automatically generates a card grid from route\nchildren metadata (icon + title)\n- **Unified error handling** – `GenericErrorPage` now uses the `Result`\ncomponent and derives status/description from the error type\n\n### ♻️ Refactors\n- **Route module split** – `app-routes.tsx` decomposed into\n`routes/auth-routes.tsx`, `routes/entity-routes.tsx`,\n`routes/movie-routes.tsx`, etc.\n- **GenericEditor navigation** – Moved from search-state\n(`useSearchState`) to URL-based routing (`path-to-regexp`)\n- **Markdown rendering** – Replaced inline `marked` usage with\n`MarkdownDisplay` from `@furystack/shades-common-components`\n\n### 🐛 Fixes\n- **monaco-mfe `registerSchema`** – Now filters existing schemas before\nadding, preventing duplicate accumulation\n- **IoT device link** – Corrected route from `/iot/device/:id` to\n`/iot/devices/:id`\n\n### ⬆️ Dependencies\n- Yarn 4.12.0 → 4.13.0\n- `@furystack/shades` ^12.2.5 → ^12.4.0\n- `@furystack/shades-common-components` ^13.3.0 → ^13.4.0\n- Removed `marked` and `@types/marked` (replaced by `MarkdownDisplay`)\n- Updated `ts-json-schema-generator`, `@types/formidable`, `lint-staged`","tree":{"sha":"8abff16124e8a62ed4c7cad71deb4f25bedd2ed1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/trees/8abff16124e8a62ed4c7cad71deb4f25bedd2ed1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/commits/3892f413002cef9b404d7a6af51c47a8d33e1649","verification":{"payload":"tree 8abff16124e8a62ed4c7cad71deb4f25bedd2ed1\nparent bf259650e5b46f2dd295ad4e4c5d8466441ab6f7\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1772802250 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772802250 +0100\n\nfeat: Layout rewamp (#122)\n\n## 🎨 Layout Revamp\n\nRefactors the frontend layout with modular routing, a redesigned login\npage, and unified error handling.\n\n### ✨ Features\n- **Login redesign** – Modern card layout with glassmorphism backdrop,\nentry animation, and inline error display\n- **PiRatLogo component** – SVG pirate-rat logo replacing the emoji in\nthe header\n- **RouteIndexPage** – Automatically generates a card grid from route\nchildren metadata (icon + title)\n- **Unified error handling** – `GenericErrorPage` now uses the `Result`\ncomponent and derives status/description from the error type\n\n### ♻️ Refactors\n- **Route module split** – `app-routes.tsx` decomposed into\n`routes/auth-routes.tsx`, `routes/entity-routes.tsx`,\n`routes/movie-routes.tsx`, etc.\n- **GenericEditor navigation** – Moved from search-state\n(`useSearchState`) to URL-based routing (`path-to-regexp`)\n- **Markdown rendering** – Replaced inline `marked` usage with\n`MarkdownDisplay` from `@furystack/shades-common-components`\n\n### 🐛 Fixes\n- **monaco-mfe `registerSchema`** – Now filters existing schemas before\nadding, preventing duplicate accumulation\n- **IoT device link** – Corrected route from `/iot/device/:id` to\n`/iot/devices/:id`\n\n### ⬆️ Dependencies\n- Yarn 4.12.0 → 4.13.0\n- `@furystack/shades` ^12.2.5 → ^12.4.0\n- `@furystack/shades-common-components` ^13.3.0 → ^13.4.0\n- Removed `marked` and `@types/marked` (replaced by `MarkdownDisplay`)\n- Updated `ts-json-schema-generator`, `@types/formidable`, `lint-staged`","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpqtDKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdK8QAKjh1+EMr3T8J1nJT51ZPvY4\n9RXXTxabV5pp39mRqIsBwMcTeKBR+3xQr0b0M0y0OBKDu7LJNESyozzelCqNLa1s\ns8PywpbEywNal2xgoyyH6P51Z/vCx4sRGphxhKOXawQtHmnAVuRoVWbv48zlPMuU\nq6aylrxP6mRmc/MLbC5CialYlowtIbn2CeBptw8yWbVpuVeaQpDO8aErUq7PivwZ\nG1QfXTYd2ZiymxuwvvTfy9cAEoXPMp5ebWPawx8raCOLX8X05XNDS5UP1MTZlsql\ntj1NkL0jNMvGZZ3D88xIDq+rLXl5E097hHdDQ