47a8d33e1649"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16716099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/bf259650e5b46f2dd295ad4e4c5d8466441ab6f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-04T12:46:36Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T12:46:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Refactor: Movie recognition scaling & Monaco MFE (#121)\n\n## 🎬 Refactor: Movie recognition scaling & Monaco MFE\n\nRefactors the movie recognition pipeline for better scalability and\nreliability when scanning large media libraries. Introduces typed result\nhandling, OMDB API rate-limit resilience with exponential backoff,\nsequential processing to avoid rate exhaustion, and detailed scan\nprogress tracking. Also extracts Monaco Editor into a standalone Micro\nFrontend to reduce frontend bundle size.\n\n### ✨ Features\n- `ScanProgress` type with per-status counters (`linked`, `rateLimited`,\n`metadataNotFound`, etc.)\n- Exponential backoff retry (up to 3 retries, 5s–60s) for OMDB\nrate-limited responses\n- `fullSync` on startup with configurable progress logging\n- Monaco Editor extracted into `monaco-mfe` package with lazy loading\nvia `@furystack/shades-mfe`\n\n### 🔧 Refactoring\n- `linkMovie` returns discriminated union results instead of throwing\n`RequestError`\n- `OmdbClientService` returns `OmdbFetchResult<T>` discriminated union\n- Movie scanning switched from `Promise.all` to sequential `for...of`\nloop\n- Replaced `semaphore-async-await` with `@furystack/utils` `Semaphore`\n- Added `execFileAsync` using `child_process.execFile` instead of\nshell-based `exec`\n- `Semaphore(3)` for ffprobe concurrency, `Semaphore(1)` for OMDB API\ncalls\n\n### ⬆️ Dependencies\n- Upgraded `@furystack/*` packages across common, frontend, and service\n- Added `@furystack/shades-mfe` to frontend\n- Removed `semaphore-async-await` from frontend","tree":{"sha":"d7a914ea3040fdb4ba41fcfa72ab8b9b879c54a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/trees/d7a914ea3040fdb4ba41fcfa72ab8b9b879c54a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/commits/bf259650e5b46f2dd295ad4e4c5d8466441ab6f7","verification":{"payload":"tree d7a914ea3040fdb4ba41fcfa72ab8b9b879c54a1\nparent 5b8fae8611b3eef6b3d64c29e977872e9305d395\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1772628396 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772628396 +0100\n\nRefactor: Movie recognition scaling & Monaco MFE (#121)\n\n## 🎬 Refactor: Movie recognition scaling & Monaco MFE\n\nRefactors the movie recognition pipeline for better scalability and\nreliability when scanning large media libraries. Introduces typed result\nhandling, OMDB API rate-limit resilience with exponential backoff,\nsequential processing to avoid rate exhaustion, and detailed scan\nprogress tracking. Also extracts Monaco Editor into a standalone Micro\nFrontend to reduce frontend bundle size.\n\n### ✨ Features\n- `ScanProgress` type with per-status counters (`linked`, `rateLimited`,\n`metadataNotFound`, etc.)\n- Exponential backoff retry (up to 3 retries, 5s–60s) for OMDB\nrate-limited responses\n- `fullSync` on startup with configurable progress logging\n- Monaco Editor extracted into `monaco-mfe` package with lazy loading\nvia `@furystack/shades-mfe`\n\n### 🔧 Refactoring\n- `linkMovie` returns discriminated union results instead of throwing\n`RequestError`\n- `OmdbClientService` returns `OmdbFetchResult<T>` discriminated union\n- Movie scanning switched from `Promise.all` to sequential `for...of`\nloop\n- Replaced `semaphore-async-await` with `@furystack/utils` `Semaphore`\n- Added `execFileAsync` using `child_process.execFile` instead of\nshell-based `exec`\n- `Semaphore(3)` for ffprobe concurrency, `Semaphore(1)` for OMDB API\ncalls\n\n### ⬆️ Dependencies\n- Upgraded `@furystack/*` packages across common, frontend, and service\n- Added `@furystack/shades-mfe` to frontend\n- Removed `semaphore-async-await` from frontend","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpqCmsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfN8QAKCzq1Tp0zBM4dyHSqsHDHG1\n04zajAosFrSDojE8WvY0/+T9+HGtIm8ZKO3khEGez476QYcho7ZDUboD6ccWJSSl\nCAtWsUDsYdT5dLOHrXOeZJphLpid8IlKG9i+hqLaImQs6CjhEOlIM0RdgSMgmYEz\ndELjT0GvxhCst79kF8btNLsnqmP9QDLKSVuRHIJg6y1X+rIHmoT/ejHBuZYXHCH1\ngv7SlyWAqGmEfbLbjZfuWpT7gITKaFnqEXOQgLqi26UHMc2b0MGvKyf0YFCCFPhK\nIX4DperTSgpBXXWDnrhrRal/lryer68VMrcT0Pj6K/QeMBQtzhpRlgOzi2EC1Xv8\nSMZkCneEJtqwMwbBO58zzjOBfF8pB7BD+6P/PwdXpuTHLor/sgjuen6jSolqwMBh\nbfTTH5VTXsQt3pmwpsI0MJV1nl/h/sujKXrwq72+wNZ5vnS5YfKx0o6LAlo3gtee\nJQCeiP86NLQbWX01o5IyFUjOAxRarsWDSZYGELyy37rIZraXEwQDaTDM70uNGkAb\nnFDKsAvk6bBsp51ENQ8mCBi9J5tQ8fa2ZdIhikjmUb8uCiA5CJB13aolQibJyqZn\nr15YQdTCmh7GdS+GaFqsuOti4QbcQfHC2buwtHVvzl/rma+Di0+pweazS7AoVnym\nyKUfmtg/r3FKSHJWKqrL\n=XoOp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-04T12:46:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url"