ttps://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/4190f9822a788e7bc2dc7c660380acb89fa4e99d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T08:42:22Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-01T08:42:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: UI consolidations (#119)\n\n## 🎨 Component Consolidation\n\nConsolidates the frontend UI by adopting shared components from\n`@furystack/shades-common-components` (v13.2.0), replacing ad-hoc\nimplementations with consistent, theme-aware equivalents.\n\n### ✨ Key Changes\n\n- **Icons**: Replaced emoji icons (🎬, 📂, 👥, etc.) with SVG `Icon`\ncomponents across all pages\n- **Theming**: Migrated hardcoded `var(--theme-*)` strings to typed\n`cssVariableTheme` tokens for compile-time safety\n- **Layout**: Adopted `PageContainer`, `PageHeader`, `Typography` for\nconsistent page structure\n- **Navigation**: Replaced custom `SettingsSidebar` with `Drawer` +\n`Menu` components\n- **Forms**: Migrated native `<select>`, `<input type=\"checkbox\">`, and\n`<textarea>` to `Select`, `Switch`, and `TextArea`\n- **Dialogs**: Replaced `Modal` + `Paper` pattern with `Dialog`\ncomponent in file info modal\n- **User Menu**: Replaced custom dropdown with `Dropdown` component\n- **Breadcrumbs**: Replaced custom breadcrumb implementation with\n`Breadcrumb` component\n- **Renamed** `Icon.tsx` → `dynamic-icon.tsx` to disambiguate from the\nshared `Icon` component\n\n### 🧪 Testing\n\n- Updated E2E tests to work with new `shade-switch`, `shade-select`, and\nrole-based selectors\n- Removed obsolete `settings-sidebar` tests alongside source deletion","tree":{"sha":"68e55c0d5e3197a1fe94bff5db774d23654e507c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/trees/68e55c0d5e3197a1fe94bff5db774d23654e507c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/commits/4190f9822a788e7bc2dc7c660380acb89fa4e99d","verification":{"payload":"tree 68e55c0d5e3197a1fe94bff5db774d23654e507c\nparent 4b48752e3757e65ee3c7dd6bc00c68e2314562e2\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1772354542 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772354542 +0000\n\nrefactor: UI consolidations (#119)\n\n## 🎨 Component Consolidation\n\nConsolidates the frontend UI by adopting shared components from\n`@furystack/shades-common-components` (v13.2.0), replacing ad-hoc\nimplementations with consistent, theme-aware equivalents.\n\n### ✨ Key Changes\n\n- **Icons**: Replaced emoji icons (🎬, 📂, 👥, etc.) with SVG `Icon`\ncomponents across all pages\n- **Theming**: Migrated hardcoded `var(--theme-*)` strings to typed\n`cssVariableTheme` tokens for compile-time safety\n- **Layout**: Adopted `PageContainer`, `PageHeader`, `Typography` for\nconsistent page structure\n- **Navigation**: Replaced custom `SettingsSidebar` with `Drawer` +\n`Menu` components\n- **Forms**: Migrated native `<select>`, `<input type=\"checkbox\">`, and\n`<textarea>` to `Select`, `Switch`, and `TextArea`\n- **Dialogs**: Replaced `Modal` + `Paper` pattern with `Dialog`\ncomponent in file info modal\n- **User Menu**: Replaced custom dropdown with `Dropdown` component\n- **Breadcrumbs**: Replaced custom breadcrumb implementation with\n`Breadcrumb` component\n- **Renamed** `Icon.tsx` → `dynamic-icon.tsx` to disambiguate from the\nshared `Icon` component\n\n### 🧪 Testing\n\n- Updated E2E tests to work with new `shade-switch`, `shade-select`, and\nrole-based selectors\n- Removed obsolete `settings-sidebar` tests alongside source deletion","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpo/vuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAm4UQAKn9qEwFWcasjRZBJVMj2MmD\nsq0G/2KIsny6ZeENyhl8R4zNOTdxFRKesvWIOe+aZqQfmpWJYBjfFvTXyB3oQNdg\n9J2HjfCprTFOgTw67RoNHI8op3bA0JPZw0BMBm2ATm2Ph9/i1ikk+3U6wazUSLRn\nA9heghc/3k7q9onp2FL5aBQa2BDjSVgdN057HQjqSdwoLKifNmtU7bwO/OenZQqn\njVziYjY/yJrdT3qx38wNYv20CLsEPkG2X8uTCzCUoRe+OmfLZVYsDvVaQ2F77d3j\nJPLVJCDwtVQMfh4XWNvyK5dYsXhN8vrZjdf4M+lfMffl64j3UCtCDfOzUzY5Klfg\n9+g7/zWpjImpkSsp+jEtrdksi+8/E0VD30s0xT5zoMMT18qyg16GgmcbvTlvR2qY\n8KF7/iY5Jctdz8mMQhyVf5TEwuIYmplLm1Udbw0yETUmIWoLds9XsgDoXL/uhxFa\nqzVr4al00e8X1Ca3H9WXFfyPyqCC4+PDVxLyqCjeTCT4Pt39CusZe5tKr2g//I1S\nFgoSvV7AencYGr08wROf3LusBh9zD9QzVVLyT7BE1XEQ0fMuA+OoURs3IBvBazuk\noo/z6ugtevUbrjGhkIfHxPRAeViRwkbo9Cr4lWMl8gzDcfC6G5V9YKltpc4bV/kz\nta2jkAhdy/54x7T1Whiy\n=wQjh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-01T08:42:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/pi-rat/commit/4190f9822a788e7bc2dc7c660380acb89fa4e99d","node_id":"C_kwDOH9jGgNoAKDQxOTBmOTgyMmE3ODhlN2JjMmRjN2M2NjAzODBhY2I4OWZhNGU5OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/pi-rat/commit/4b48752e3757e65ee3c7dd6bc00c68e2314562e2","sha":"4b48752e3757e65ee3c7dd6bc00c68e2314562e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/4b48752e3757e65ee3c7dd6bc00c68e2314562e2"}],"sha":"4190f9822a788e7bc2dc7c660380acb89fa4e99d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/4190f9822a788e7bc2dc7c660380acb89fa4e99d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16716099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/4b48752e3757e65ee3c7dd6bc00c68e2314562e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T11:50:50Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T11:50:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Refactor/frontend simplifications (#118)\n\n## ♻️ Frontend Simplifications\n\nRefactoring pass across the frontend to reduce code duplication and\nimprove resource cleanup.\n\n### 📦 Extracted Components\n- **`WidgetCard`** – shared card layout, focus/blur animations, overlay,\nand title bar used by all dashboard widgets\n- **`widget-animations.ts`** – centralized animation timing, easing\ncurves, and helpers (`widgetEntrance`, `widgetCoverFocus`,\n`widgetCoverBlur`)\n- **`MediaOverviewLayout`** – shared poster + details layout for movie\nand series overview pages\n- **`triggerDownload()`** – utility replacing inline download-via-anchor\npattern\n\n### 🧹 Cleanup\n- Removed always-true `ENABLE_MEDIA_CHROME` flag and its unused fallback\nbranch from the movie player\n- Simplified `WizardStep` from imperative ref-based resizing to\ndeclarative CSS\n- Simplified `UserDetailsContent` state management using `useState`\ninstead of manual `ObservableValue`\n- Wrapped bare `setTimeout` calls in `useDisposable` for proper cleanup\non disposal\n- Replaced `interface` with `type` and `any` with `unknown` across\nseveral files\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fix\n- Fixed CSS `calc()` missing closing parenthesis in movie/series\noverview pages","tree":{"sha":"c1ba34f344e72257598d76865b01077f6ce6143a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/trees/c1ba34f344e72257598d76865b01077f6ce6143a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/commits/4b48752e3757e65ee3c7dd6bc00c68e2314562e2","verification":{"payload":"tree c1ba34f344e72257598d76865b01077f6ce6143a\nparent 49083c6be98d46a972705bbe803756c13803c138\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1772279450 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772279450 +0100\n\nRefactor/frontend simplifications (#118)\n\n## ♻️ Frontend Simplifications\n\nRefactoring pass across the frontend to reduce code duplication and\nimprove resource cleanup.\n\n### 📦 Extracted Components\n- **`WidgetCard`** – shared card layout, focus/blur animations, overlay,\nand title bar used by all dashboard widgets\n- **`widget-animations.ts`** – centralized animation timing, easing\ncurves, and helpers (`widgetEntrance`, `widgetCoverFocus`,\n`widgetCoverBlur`)\n- **`MediaOverviewLayout`** – shared poster + details layout for movie\nand series overview pages\n- **`triggerDownload()`** – utility replacing inline download-via-anchor\npattern\n\n### 🧹 Cleanup\n- Removed always-true `ENABLE_MEDIA_CHROME` flag and its unused fallback\nbranch from the movie player\n- Simplified `WizardStep` from imperative ref-based resizing to\ndeclarative CSS\n- Simplified `UserDetailsContent` state management using `useState`\ninstead of manual `ObservableValue`\n- Wrapped bare `setTimeout` calls in `useDisposable` for proper cleanup\non disposal\n- Replaced `interface` with `type` and `any` with `unknown` across\nseveral files\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fix\n- Fixed CSS `calc()` missing closing parenthesis in movie/series\noverview pages","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpotaaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArawQAGIHllM1pINcEw76IZkXWQOi\nvz0rshUhmXFO0kYAhwkVdM3k/6oxgktOZEvHtCMqQvY8HdBC588k1xtHX3Fav5Mm\nXK/b6oxcBLV7H9OyoJMf/DFjukHNSTo90t3jpRYNBHV0qOhRSntvpeM+LVXcNQMS\neN+J9LpMpiA05pkMHahhLwiUpjdH9lmkw7i80rrZMX+hex05wlJCn88mcxtQ1G4U\nfTpza+2MCBKpaLNmFzgy5domPk8lM3DUV0qjpO1eBgyaIoLTDaPD1YwCUDCoJpU2\nnZTb6Oep9ehK8LcJp9DisOAkxFZD7fKJP7TPpPB0CXtTN3XbwnNb8jdO+//lRosH\nfYbDr/oyvYF/AfZnjOWc9WUeWzoVfHbOfqP+Jomy6S6ANS0KpV82SFw73LNt8U0E\nYUzDCjeAFVdtK31bWaYWjDMTJ1N1XE7pOjDhL2yDctBTpmLzgmBjIbVtnIuIfnI2\nViwSBfxo8fkKs66gPMhO8sV7DRUr0xGIHp070xads+6OLKHgZ6tnvzXQV/K/LELR\nkvOrd85quyIUDMg8c0munmWzVs1tfb/HM+q1R5gldl5LVC8MKTSknHYnab9FLRKy\nZnmnzwPjLkCxT71kopGUnTyb8JU0WeCGKkskgoehvT1IvENyj1aq4yHvoMnpbpWn\njLdsDd/5osKtfRB5/Yb+\n=IT1g\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-28T11:50:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/w