users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/49083c6be98d46a972705bbe803756c13803c138/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T10:26:53Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T10:26:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: form handling improvements (#117)\n\n## ♻️ Summary\n\nExtracts inline form validation callbacks from 15+ frontend components\ninto standalone, exported type guard functions with explicit payload\ntypes. Replaces `Record<string, unknown>` casts and manual `FormData`\nextraction with strongly-typed `onSubmit` callbacks provided by the\n`Form` component. Refactors `WizardStep` to delegate to `Form`\ninternally.\n\n## 🧪 Tests\n\nAdded unit tests for all extracted type guards covering field presence,\ntype checking, empty values, and domain-specific constraints (password\nmatching, URL validation, numeric ranges).","tree":{"sha":"bdf16806481145223069b8763075bb8695926766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/trees/bdf16806481145223069b8763075bb8695926766"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/commits/49083c6be98d46a972705bbe803756c13803c138","verification":{"payload":"tree bdf16806481145223069b8763075bb8695926766\nparent 7170298f61465d2e1be9a0696d19a4220029f479\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1772274413 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772274413 +0000\n\nfeat: form handling improvements (#117)\n\n## ♻️ Summary\n\nExtracts inline form validation callbacks from 15+ frontend components\ninto standalone, exported type guard functions with explicit payload\ntypes. Replaces `Record<string, unknown>` casts and manual `FormData`\nextraction with strongly-typed `onSubmit` callbacks provided by the\n`Form` component. Refactors `WizardStep` to delegate to `Form`\ninternally.\n\n## 🧪 Tests\n\nAdded unit tests for all extracted type guards covering field presence,\ntype checking, empty values, and domain-specific constraints (password\nmatching, URL validation, numeric ranges).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJposLtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdocQAJxJTA9i/rdTr7Gj7seV5S6M\nYpgPY+Hx2/3Mia2ID/qK4ntwMstGPdzVCxKhEmPCDQWMtLzyhjKBKKiA9+Td4vF3\n9bjuJscAq1JiH66pWnRS8+kmtloK9A5Gwqd6rCnT4s7xdQlK8KWyO81glp3O9hAi\npfTXCu1fo3tfnnIFbJdGFxhUjlN4LJmcbbc93ilXoWC1UoV6qU1WGRD8XxhSfBHH\n6zqcRmWWnNc26rqY9/4Dsc4AnFejdaqq+lWS7xVJoGkaK6DjpCtsIXULoINHdCzJ\n97T1tIz0D5b98thCXEjIvxvu6mC0D0W/1b1O0dxWfy8z0dVOccuqwL+Cxmyk3aLW\ni8C5HRIgi9TkBTQITN+hTVNTB81gkp4yvO2SQ/8KyC4F72wIViGXFCikkVe+liA/\njh6/hXOYgJhEDrW4roJkGTRt4wo8/UwLHtyVtfLTYGXXf3iZL0VG8v3dyHg5Gk3q\nzqzQbx5KChb0bnYs5ou241fOMtLtCphynfRIJuhKzlxwstC0w5nNwzMM6tMthlXM\nyWZ91PftP7OJ9sXKsgXEqb1ysnuyIS1GQWnxeCSkWp8VDwf5vfpBT9w3pTFT7XzD\nu7TBQjUCkMnAX95AQfeDr2gCMk49ThWnyGZGsk00d1LuDzjv8G5Bl6wo50RwCpMZ\ndcfJYvV4nQqC0X/kjrKD\n=hZUt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-28T10:26:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/pi-rat/commit/49083c6be98d46a972705bbe803756c13803c138","node_id":"C_kwDOH9jGgNoAKDQ5MDgzYzZiZTk4ZDQ2YTk3MjcwNWJiZTgwMzc1NmMxMzgwM2MxMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/furystack/pi-rat/commit/7170298f61465d2e1be9a0696d19a4220029f479","sha":"7170298f61465d2e1be9a0696d19a4220029f479","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/7170298f61465d2e1be9a0696d19a4220029f479"}],"sha":"49083c6be98d46a972705bbe803756c13803c138","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/49083c6be98d46a972705bbe803756c13803c138"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16716099?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gallayl","id":16716099,"login":"gallayl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE2MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gallayl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/commits/7170298f61465d2e1be9a0696d19a4220029f479/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:39:49Z","email":"gallayl@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lajos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:39:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: Cache views (#116)\n\n## 🔄 Refactor: Migrate components to CacheView\n\nReplace manual cache state handling\n(`isPendingCacheResult`/`isLoadedCacheResult`/`isFailedCacheResult`)\nwith the `CacheView` component from\n`@furystack/shades-common-components`. Each affected component is split\ninto a wrapper (provides `CacheView` with cache + args) and a content\ncomponent (receives `data: CacheWithValue<T>`).\n\nThis reduces boilerplate, standardizes loading/error/content rendering,\nand leverages the framework''s built-in cache subscription management.\n\n### 📦 Changes\n\n- Refactored 15 frontend components to use `CacheView`\n- Made `ConfigService.configCache` public\n- Added `GenericErrorPage` error handlers to admin settings and user\nmanagement pages\n- Bumped `@furystack/shades-common-components` ^13.0.1 → ^13.1.0\n- Bumped `eslint-plugin-playwright` ^2.7.1 → ^2.8.0","tree":{"sha":"760477a5f9f52e529822a6c4c53282ea5211c9c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/trees/760477a5f9f52e529822a6c4c53282ea5211c9c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/furystack/pi-rat/git/commits/7170298f61465d2e1be9a0696d19a4220029f479","verification":{"payload":"tree 760477a5f9f52e529822a6c4c53282ea5211c9c9\nparent 9b6ac12f58a7e91459e7835e62cf8d8cfb4b4029\nauthor Lajos <gallayl@users.noreply.github.com> 1772267989 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772267989 +0000\n\nrefactor: Cache views (#116)\n\n## 🔄 Refactor: Migrate components to CacheView\n\nReplace manual cache state handling\n(`isPendingCacheResult`/`isLoadedCacheResult`/`isFailedCacheResult`)\nwith the `CacheView` component from\n`@furystack/shades-common-components`. Each affected component is split\ninto a wrapper (provides `CacheView` with cache + args) and a content\ncomponent (receives `data: CacheWithValue<T>`).\n\nThis reduces boilerplate, standardizes loading/error/content rendering,\nand leverages the framework''s built-in cache subscription management.\n\n### 📦 Changes\n\n- Refactored 15 frontend components to use `CacheView`\n- Made `ConfigService.configCache` public\n- Added `GenericErrorPage` error handlers to admin settings and user\nmanagement pages\n- Bumped `@furystack/shades-common-components` ^13.0.1 → ^13.1.0\n- Bumped `eslint-plugin-playwright` ^2.7.1 → ^2.8.0","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpoqnVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+CkQAGFTXT9dcNOB280W+hHXODVU\nG3cvSpacarf+tP+4j/gRaAAgKFsd5izZw7zbvi0ULOFcih6rVj4ieD000EJWkc+7\nokZk1zr6NkevIigwI0qxDeOamHxgf//ajb2ERrOvazRonjkqIbBOLWF3+Z16vXuO\nunwNhPx2qKYOBVbtZaF42MVeGX+9rkkHtdAsv93RuJafY0zm4nwMcCKvqrKttXJV\ns6n3UBDa3kCzo2DLr2rLQxq3TvzWV3gPGN+h/mfhW/MxTCyfpC9wnS1NWuufTO6O\ncBF1O//yqDgIPiJAnoWyLjeVyGk1Zz8AZMu4yLc9JHH5vM75ueStzb9efspRxh11\n0iFN3idfOebcbTzdcT5OR1ng8gkmoDqXs3I03aRpz7BhT0eqFga/D0Vxzi4HA6gp\nJbQE8Cc8A3yIbtnPD1yQf2L6NsT7iA1iPL4cN7aK4wQGt6oVpsp4czJ68yF+Z8NI\n7xagVKyiVBOsy2AfrH+XgNYkTJKa0PE+vQbCAOh/e0BgYGDYQqeBXslyQGn0UPOk\nFMO5qzpeHh/EYJe7orOcey+AVNPEeAJaK36XabfxPbrAMF9T1uqR5r6fAZCK0MCS\nXaOyXl3zSpb/yCc8ePwf8IRxbJs0efztktsvb6eslUEu0xzkHFdF8DAWpz2/F9kU\nHixlVWSw+lxKFewE+wbo\n=G/Ba\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-28T08:39:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/re