{"date":"2026-07-23T07:47:58Z","email":"lorainwings@gmail.com","name":"lorain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T07:47:58Z","email":"lorainwings@gmail.com","name":"lorain"},"message":"fix(micro-frontends): 修复 404 重定向两处真实 bug\n\n经真实浏览器端到端验证, 上次修复未生效, 根因有二:\n\n1. 404.html 正则用 ^/micro-frontends 锚定, 但 GitHub Pages\n   project page 的 pathname 带仓库名前缀 (/demos/micro-frontends/...),\n   永远匹配不上 → 落到 else 显示 404 文本。\n   改为 indexOf 动态定位 /micro-frontends/ 段, 保留 base 前缀。\n\n2. qiankun 主应用的 history.replaceState 放在 createApp 之后,\n   Vue Router 初始化后监听到 URL 变化, 把未知路由 /app-vue\n   重定向回首页 → 子应用无法激活。\n   改为在 createApp / Vue Router 初始化之前恢复 URL。\n\n验证: 本地模拟 GitHub Pages (含 /demos 前缀 + 404 fallback),\n用 Chrome 实测 qiankun Vue/React、single-spa Vue 子应用均正常渲染。","tree":{"sha":"f47cb31f21a540fc36ea2f6a8fb66328c13ef302","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stoicatom/demos/git/trees/f47cb31f21a540fc36ea2f6a8fb66328c13ef302"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stoicatom/demos/git/commits/0569ecd2476a73058c5f54545225da07d9f3b796","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40715103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stoicatom","id":40715103,"login":"stoicatom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzE1MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stoicatom/demos/commit/0569ecd2476a73058c5f54545225da07d9f3b796","node_id":"C_kwDOH-wDFdoAKDA1NjllY2QyNDc2YTczMDU4YzVmNTQ1NDUyMjVkYTA3ZDlmM2I3OTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stoicatom/demos/commit/e6c26fea9cced7132aff624652a7083aa5503957","sha":"e6c26fea9cced7132aff624652a7083aa5503957","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stoicatom/demos/commits/e6c26fea9cced7132aff624652a7083aa5503957"}],"sha":"0569ecd2476a73058c5f54545225da07d9f3b796","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stoicatom/demos/commits/0569ecd2476a73058c5f54545225da07d9f3b796"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40715103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stoicatom","id":40715103,"login":"stoicatom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzE1MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stoicatom/demos/commits/e6c26fea9cced7132aff624652a7083aa5503957/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:35:12Z","email":"lorainwings@gmail.com","name":"lorain"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T06:35:12Z","email":"lorainwings@gmail.com","name":"lorain"},"message":"fix(ci): pages.yml 增加 keep_files 防止删除 micro-frontends\n\npages.yml 每次 push master 都触发,默认行为会删除 gh-pages 上\n不在 publish_dir(./code-snippets/htmls) 的文件,包括:\n  - /micro-frontends/ (整个目录)\n  - /404.html (根 404 fallback)\n\n这会导致 micro-frontends.yml 的部署被覆盖。必须加 keep_files: true\n让两个 workflow 互不干扰,各自维护自己的部署区域","tree":{"sha":"d08053dabd765975c5ecb27040b43057159ae367","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stoicatom/demos/git/trees/d08053dabd765975c5ecb27040b43057159ae367"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stoicatom/demos/git/commits/e6c26fea9cced7132aff624652a7083aa5503957","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40715103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/stoicatom","id":40715103,"login":"stoicatom","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzE1MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stoicatom","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/stoicatom/demos/commit/e6c26fea9cced7132aff624652a7083aa5503957","node_id":"C_kwDOH-wDFdoAKGU2YzI2ZmVhOWNjZWQ3MTMyYWZmNjI0NjUyYTcwODNhYTU1MDM5NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/stoicatom/demos/commit/f62c69f9c15d3421b17e26b1c042d1b6748bc2c7","sha":"f62c69f9c15d3421b17e26b1c042d1b6748bc2c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stoicatom/demos/