45c634531/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T02:10:35Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T02:10:35Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"docs: give core and app developers separate entry points\n\nHelp > Developer > Developer''s Guide opens the wiki page\nCytoscape-Web-Developer-Tutorial, which describes the 2025 code base and\naddresses core developers only. That page becomes a hub in a follow-up;\nthis change readies the in-repo docs it will link to.\n\n- docs/guides/README.md is now the Core Developer''s Guide: an index of\n  the contributor docs that links to each owner instead of repeating it.\n- README: describe both app types (Module Federation apps -> the\n  examples repo, service apps -> the wiki spec) in place of the\n  pre-beta App API warning; require Node 24, show how mise reads\n  .nvmrc, point at the dev1 NDEx server, link DEBUG_GUIDE.\n- CONTRIBUTING: oxlint + tsc instead of ESLint, Prettier is not checked\n  automatically, Node 24, link the index.\n- docs/README.md: list all 13 specs, add the index, fix the LicenseMenu\n  link broken since that menu moved under Help.\n- HelpMenu.md: the menu layout as it is now.\n- AGENTS.md and the completion checklist: docs change with behavior.\n- Rename DEBUG_GUIDE.MD to DEBUG_GUIDE.md so *.md globs find it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"024b371211c88f012196a09903ba9a36320fdce4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/024b371211c88f012196a09903ba9a36320fdce4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/0553d5a4814eb3367a8ca91aefc073a45c634531","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url