e":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/549082093213f96beb31ad150ad157ac2a7b6d39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:30:23Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:30:23Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"docs(api-types): address the review of the beta.5 release notes\n\nAdd the Fixed section the beta.5 entry was missing: deleteNetwork now\ndeletes a workspace network that has never been shown instead of failing\nwith APP1 (#794), and deleting the network the address bar names moves\nthe URL off it (#792). Both change the public API''s behaviour; the\nearlier check compared declarations only, so it could not see them.\n\nReplace the host-compatibility check. \"At or after a seven-character\nhash\" cannot be evaluated: hashes carry no order, and the tag does not\nexist in a consumer''s repository. Give an ancestry check to run in a\nclone of cytoscape-web instead, verified against the beta.4 tag.\n\nName the type to annotate with when moving components to resources:\nCyAppWithLifecycle, which declares resources and mount(). The review\nsuggested telling CyApp users to switch, but no published 1.0.0 beta\nexports CyApp, so the notes say that instead of assuming apps used it.\n\nStop calling beta.5 \"one breaking change; the rest is additive\" when\nthe same section lists two source-breaking additions, and separate the\nrequired panel member in the types from its absence on an older host.\n\nPin the App API Reference link to the api-types-v1.0.0-beta.5 tag,\nsince the README ships in an immutable tarball, and add the step to the\nrunbook so the next release moves it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5892838a145658d7a3ee3cf6dd9aa3937d3c8195","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/5892838a145658d7a3ee3cf6dd9aa3937d3c8195"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/549082093213f96beb31ad150ad157ac2a7b6d39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/549082093213f96beb31ad150ad157ac2a7b6d39","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDU0OTA4MjA5MzIxM2Y5NmJlYjMxYWQxNTBhZDE1N2FjMmE3YjZkMzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/56ff341e12a97fa5ed942f1a9ce9b10e5596f551","sha":"56ff341e12a97fa5ed942f1a9ce9b10e5596f551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/56ff341e12a97fa5ed942f1a9ce9b10e5596f551"}],"sha":"549082093213f96beb31ad150ad157ac2a7b6d39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/549082093213f96beb31ad150ad157ac2a7b6d39"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/56ff341e12a97fa5ed942f1a9ce9b10e5596f551/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:34:58Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T20:34:58Z","email":"keiono@gmail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"docs(api-types): prepare the 1.0.0-beta.5 release\n\nDate the beta.5 CHANGELOG section (the release workflow refuses\n\"(unpublished)\") and open it with the host-compatibility block the runbook\nrequires: which build implements this API, where it runs, and how to check\na deployment.\n\nCorrect the parameter-spec entry: it called the record-keyed layout\nparameter shape \"the unpublished beta.4 shape\", but beta.4 was published on\n2026-09-11 without it. That shape existed only on development between the\ntwo releases, so the change breaks no published version.\n\nREADME, which npmjs.com renders: add beta.5 migration notes for the\nCyApp.components removal, including that an app referencing the\nComponentType const no longer loads at all; add PanelApi, DialogApi and\nthe layout registration types to the export table, and cyweb/PanelApi,\ncyweb/ScopedApi and cyweb/AppDataApi to the remotes table; drop the stale\n\"10 domain API objects\" count; fix the per-app context example, which\ntreated getRegisteredResources() as returning an array; and point the\ndocumentation list at Api.md, the reference that is kept current, rather\nthan the July specification.\n\npackages/README.md: version table to 1.0.0-beta.5.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f0ded72a16394c1406e4fabb8a4f8b936b7b657e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/f0ded72a16394c1406e4fabb8a4f8b936b7b657e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/56ff341e12a97fa5ed942f1a9ce9b10e5596f551","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/56ff341e12a97fa5ed942f1a9ce9b10e5596f551","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDU2ZmYzNDFlMTJhOTdmYTVlZDk0MmYxYTljZTliMTBlNTU5NmY1NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/c66154f62bd8b0191e90e48afcba72efcb1fa382","sha":"c66154f62bd8b0191e90e48afcba72efcb1f