/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/6355288b34462fc2c307dc1732c1cdeab7be5e7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:31:05Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:31:05Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"fix(HierarchyViewer): show only the filter the aspect defines (#798)\n\nPicking another attribute in the filter panel emptied the checkbox list:\nthe switcher never rebuilt the stored config, and CheckboxFilter got the\ntable of the panel''s own Nodes/Edges state while the config still named\nthe aspect''s attribute and target. Switching to Nodes also replaced the\nedge filter''s visibility bypass with one keyed by node ids, so every edge\nshowed again.\n\nThe team decided the panel shows only the filter the subnetwork''s\nfilterWidgets aspect defines. So:\n\n- createFilterFromAspect returns one config, from the first valid entry,\n  and warns about the others. Every entry used to be registered under\n  the subnetwork id, so each overwrote the previous one and the last\n  entry won without a warning.\n- FilterPanel drops the attribute switcher (Nodes/Edges radios, column\n  dropdown) and the gear that expanded it, and AttributeSelector is\n  deleted. The panel takes the attribute, target and table from the\n  stored config.\n- The color mapping for the swatches is looked up only among visual\n  properties of the filter''s target.\n- The panel''s unread ''checkboxFilter'' default registration is gone; the\n  name now lives in restoreUrlState, its only user.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c14c7e9e48e8fb8300b248def4aaedcf189307a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/c14c7e9e48e8fb8300b248def4aaedcf189307a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/6355288b34462fc2c307dc1732c1cdeab7be5e7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/6355288b34462fc2c307dc1732c1cdeab7be5e7a","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDYzNTUyODhiMzQ0NjJmYzJjMzA3ZGMxNzMyYzFjZGVhYjdiZTVlN2E","paren