committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:20:41Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"docs(lessons): loading an HCX file for manual Hierarchy Viewer checks\n\nFound while checking #796 in the browser pane:\nCyWebApi.network.createNetworkFromCx2 does not make an HCX file a\nhierarchy, and getTable rows come back as an array.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"47eeaea5158d70139125d2af68eddfd003bf74b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/47eeaea5158d70139125d2af68eddfd003bf74b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/c7da74e9270d5b0e685d0f9b95560f26de0fd8d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/c7da74e9270d5b0e685d0f9b95560f26de0fd8d3","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKGM3ZGE3NGU5MjcwZDViMGU2ODVkMGY5Yjk1NTYwZjI2ZGUwZmQ4ZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/3ca79ede6d9d9232e06fde68e2fbd3d7e9fb8c1a","sha":"3ca79ede6d9d9232e06fde68e2fbd3d7e9fb8c1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/3ca79ede6d9d9232e06fde68e2fbd3d7e9fb8c1a"}],"sha":"c7da74e9270d5b0e685d0f9b95560f26de0fd8d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/c7da74e9270d5b0e685d0f9b95560f26de0fd8d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/3ca79ede6d9d9232e06fde68e2fbd3d7e9fb8c1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:20:41Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:20:41Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"fix(HierarchyViewer): render list, boolean and missing values; link URLs and Ensembl ids (#796)\n\nThe Hierarchy Viewer''s property panel and Visibility Toggle filter passed\nraw table values to React, which joins array items with nothing between\nthem and renders true, false, null and undefined as nothing.\n\nProperty panel\n- AttributeValue renders values through a pure formatter\n  (utils/attributeValueDisplay.ts): list items joined with \", \",\n  booleans as true/false.\n- A missing value shows a muted, italic N/A (NoValueLabel), so it cannot\n  be mistaken for a literal \"N/A\" string. The panel now lists every\n  node-table column, as the Nodes table does.\n- A value (or list item) that is entirely an http(s) URL becomes a link\n  opening in a new tab (rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"); no other scheme is\n  linked. ensembl:ENSG<11 digits>, case-insensitive with an optional\n  version suffix, links to NCBI Gene with the version dropped and the\n  original text kept. A bare ENSG id is not linked. Identifier links\n  come from the IDENTIFIER_LINKS table.\n\nCheckbox filter\n- Boolean options are labelled true/false; labels never contain links.\n- Numbers sort numerically, false before true; strings keep code-unit\n  order.\n- Elements without a value share one N/A option, listed last. Checking\n  it, or Select All, shows them. Before, null and undefined each got a\n  blank option, and the undefined one never showed its elements.\n\n\"Missing\" means null, no such attribute, or a blank string\n(isMissingValue in valueTypeImpl). The table browser shows all three as\nan empty cell, and clearing a string cell there writes ''''. The N/A option\nis stored as null in the range: DiscreteFilterValue = ValueType | null\nwidens FilterConfig''s discrete range, simpleFilter matches missing values\nto it (toDiscreteFilterValue), and the IndexedDB validator accepts null\nin a discrete range, so a saved filter with N/A checked still restores.\n\nList-valued filter columns and switching the filter attribute from the\ngear options are out of scope (tracked separately).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0ea9ef7b06c27f881b9f5771d6d2ad48eee3202","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/b0ea9ef7b06c27f881b9f5771d6d2ad48eee3202"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/3ca79ede6d9d9232e06fde68e2fbd3d7e9fb8c1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/3ca79ede6d9d9232e06fde68e2fbd3d7e9fb8c1a","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDNjYTc5ZWRlNmQ5ZDkyMzJlMDZmZGU2OGUyZmJkM2Q3ZTlmYjhjMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/ee0c0fd361849631b7e81fa941d542b08d34143b","sha":"ee0c0fd361849631b7e81fa941d542b08d34143b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/ee0c0fd361849631b7e81fa941d542b08d34143b"}],"sha":"3ca79ede6d9d9232e06fde68e2fbd3d7e9fb8c1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/3ca79ede6d9d9232e06fde68e2fbd3d7e9fb8c1a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/51cff82bfc3e2629d71f51eace0e59600fa8afa0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:15:49Z","email":"keiono@Studio-M5.local","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:15:49Z","email":"keiono@Studio-M5.local","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"Merge branch ''development'' into chore/786-remove-components-api\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b8f2b0e151963c16059be751cfad3f0ac4f9370b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/b8f2b0e151963c16059be751cfad3f0ac4f9370b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/51cff82bfc3e2629d71f51eace0e59600fa8afa0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/51cff82bfc3e2629d71f51eace0e59600fa8afa0","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDUxY2ZmODJiZmMzZTI2MjlkNzFmNTFlYWNlMGU1OTYwMGZhOGFmYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/58122af860cb993db74691000dc0012af39aa2de","sha":"58122af860cb993db74691000dc0012af39aa2de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/58122af860cb993db74691000dc0012af39aa2de"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/ee0c0fd361849631b7e81fa941d542b08d34143b","sha":"ee0c0fd361849631b7e81fa941d542b08d34143b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/ee0c0fd361849631b7e81fa941d542b08d34143b"}],"sha":"51cff82bfc3e2629d71f51eace0e59600fa8afa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/51cff82bfc3e2629d71f51eace0e59600fa8afa0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/58122af860cb993db74691000dc0012af39aa2de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T19:39:57Z","email":"keiono@Studio-M5.local","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T19:39:57Z","email":"keiono@Studio-M5.local","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"docs(api-types): say which legacy apps still load after removing components (#786)\n\nThe entry said an app that still exports `components` \"loads and mounts\nas before\". That holds for string `type` values only: an app that uses\nthe `ComponentType` const at runtime, the form the migration table itself\nshows, now throws while its ./AppConfig is evaluated and does not load.\nAlso note that the warning is shown by default only in development\nbuilds, and that a stale field is dropped when an app enters AppStore\nrather than when its record is read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ceb241927b8f7ec4c7aa7bba8521ba251a0f8c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/1ceb241927b8f7ec4c7aa7bba8521ba251a0f8c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/58122af860cb993db74691000dc0012af39aa2de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/58122af860cb993db74691000dc0012af39aa2de","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDU4MTIyYWY4NjBjYjk5M2RiNzQ2OTEwMDBkYzAwMTJhZjM5YWEyZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/689c801354c6a9c6233408a4f8d395068583e50a","sha":"689c801354c6a9c6233408a4f8d395068583e50a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/689c801354c6a9c6233408a4f8d395068583e50a"}],"sha":"58122af860cb993db74691000dc0012af39aa2de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/58122af860cb993db74691000dc0012af39aa2de"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/689c801354c6a9c6233408a4f8d395068583e50a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T19:39:10Z","email":"keiono@Studio-M5.local","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T19:39:10Z","email":"keiono@Studio-M5.local","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"docs(db): say that CyApp read-path validation does not strip components (#786)\n\nThe schema comment and the test said a pre-#786 record \"parses and comes\nback without\" `components`. zod''s parsed value does, but observeValidation\ndiscards it and getAppFromDb returns the raw record, so every caller still\nsees the field. Say that, point at toStoredApp as what keeps it out of\nAppStore, and have the test check only what callers rely on: the record is\naccepted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94258f770ec7760e739f08fc6f0605ac40388d23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/94258f770ec7760e739f08fc6f0605ac40388d23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/689c801354c6a9c6233408a4f8d395068583e50a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/689c801354c6a9c6233408a4f8d395068583e50a","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDY4OWM4MDEzNTRjNmE5YzYyMzM0MDhhNGY4ZDM5NTA2ODU4M2U1MGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/f7c3a7e694d247236d0359de1959f8bea861ceeb","sha":"f7c3a7e694d247236d0359de1959f8bea861ceeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/f7c3a7e694d247236d0359de1959f8bea861ceeb"}],"sha":"689c801354c6a9c6233408a4f8d395068583e50a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/689c801354c6a9c6233408a4f8d395068583e50a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/f7c3a7e694d247236d0359de1959f8bea861ceeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T19:38:46Z","email":"keiono@Studio-M5.local","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T19:38:46Z","email":"keiono@Studio-M5.local","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"fix(AppManager): warn about legacy components only when some are declared (#786)\n\n`Object.hasOwn` also matched `components: []`, which the example apps\ncarried as a placeholder until their beta.4 migration, so such an app was\ntold to migrate declarations it never made. Warn only for a non-empty\narray, where entries are actually dropped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"988fa1b9b2eb2d61cda71bf27c06bc85f58c639f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/988fa1b9b2eb2d61cda71bf27c06bc85f58c639f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/f7c3a7e694d247236d0359de1959f8bea861ceeb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/f7c3a7e694d247236d0359de1959f8bea861ceeb","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKGY3YzNhN2U2OTRkMjQ3MjM2ZDAzNTlkZTE5NTlmOGJlYTg2MWNlZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/c2c9138896622283562308f164a461c54021ea2c","sha":"c2c9138896622283562308f164a461c54021ea2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/c2c9138896622283562308f164a461c54021ea2c"}],"sha":"f7c3a7e694d247236d0359de1959f8bea861ceeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/f7c3a7e694d247236d0359de1959f8bea861ceeb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/re