so it would have\ndescribed the removed API to anyone hovering the method. Api.md was\nalready corrected in the removal commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8007ea6c03f046b61b50268316ce3eea0a4e6dbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/8007ea6c03f046b61b50268316ce3eea0a4e6dbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/446007f85fbf4dec3e5999d6d5e9600c09e9f0a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/446007f85fbf4dec3e5999d6d5e9600c09e9f0a4","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDQ0NjAwN2Y4NWZiZjRkZWMzZTU5OTlkNmQ1ZTk2MDBjMDllOWYwYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/6ff64ddffee74890da5cb373718c60b48528449d","sha":"6ff64ddffee74890da5cb373718c60b48528449d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/6ff64ddffee74890da5cb373718c60b48528449d"}],"sha":"446007f85fbf4dec3e5999d6d5e9600c09e9f0a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/446007f85fbf4dec3e5999d6d5e9600c09e9f0a4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/6ff64ddffee74890da5cb373718c60b48528449d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:39:15Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:39:15Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"refactor(AppManager): rename ExternalComponent to loader/remoteModuleLoader\n\nAfter #786 the file renders nothing. What is left registers a remote\nwith the Module Federation runtime and loads one exposed module, and its\nonly caller is loader/loadRemoteApp.ts. The name and the .tsx extension\ndescribed the lazy-component wrapper that was removed.\n\nMoved next to its caller, with its test. The log prefix follows the\nfile name. No behavior change.\n\nThe design documents under docs/design/module-federation/ keep the old\nname: they describe the code as it was when they were written.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db6704dfde30e0e12de9994099d82a5a02c00054","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/db6704dfde30e0e12de9994099d82a5a02c00054"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/6ff64ddffee74890da5cb373718c60b48528449d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/6ff64ddffee74890da5cb373718c60b48528449d","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDZmZjY0ZGRmZmVlNzQ4OTBkYTVjYjM3MzcxOGM2MGI0ODUyODQ0OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/a48892365cf631a24a05f0378da98ca64e0426b4","sha":"a48892365cf631a24a05f0378da98ca64e0426b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/a48892365cf631a24a05f0378da98ca64e0426b4"}],"sha":"6ff64ddffee74890da5cb373718c60b48528449d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/6ff64ddffee74890da5cb373718c60b48528449d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/a48892365cf631a24a05f0378da98ca64e0426b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:34:40Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:34:40Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"refactor(app-api)!: remove the deprecated CyApp.components API (#786)\n\nCyApp.components was the original, manifest-style way for an app to\ncontribute UI: a list of { id, type: ''menu'' | ''panel'', component? }\nentries resolved through Module Federation. It has been deprecated since\n`resources` and runtime registration arrived, and #784 left its menu half\nwithout a use: a legacy menu component is mounted as a row, a row\nunmounts when the menu closes, so it cannot show UI of its own. The\npanel half goes with it, which leaves one way to contribute a panel.\n\nRemoved: the field, ComponentMetadata, ComponentType and AppComponent,\ntheir re-exports from the App API types, the manifest branches in the\nApps menu and the side panel, and the lazy-component half of\nExternalComponent, which had no caller left. loadModule stays; it loads\n./AppConfig, the only module the host loads from an app.\n\nThe type is gone but the data is not. An app bundle is untyped at\nruntime, and an app record saved by an older host still has the field,\nso:\n\n- toStoredApp (appStoreImpl) drops `components` along with `resources`\n  wherever an app record enters the store, restore() included. Both can\n  hold React.lazy refs, which crash React once Immer freezes them.\n- CyAppSchema no longer requires `components`. It was a mandatory array,\n  so every record written after the removal would have failed read-path\n  validation. Old records still parse and come back without the field.\n- loadRemoteApp warns, naming the app, when a bundle still declares the\n  field. The app loads and mounts as before.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: `CyApp.components`, `ComponentMetadata` and\n`ComponentType` are removed from @cytoscape-web/api-types 1.0.0-beta.5.\nDeclare panels as { slot: ''right-panel'', id, title, component } and menu\nentries as { slot: ''apps-menu'', id, label, onClick(apis) } in\n`resources`, opening any UI from onClick through apis.dialog.open. See\npackages/api-types/CHANGELOG.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46f01ee3d6d6b400f56244249aec7837488eceeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/46f01ee3d6d6b400f56244249aec7837488eceeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/a48892365cf631a24a05f0378da98ca64e0426b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","foll