":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/795863405c3d0b74c58b12b33ce0a3efed91cfde/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:26:12Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:26:12Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"refactor(DataMenu): own the Cytoscape Desktop permission notice (#784)\n\nThe Open Network in Cytoscape Desktop row rendered the first-use\npermission notice itself and kept the Data menu open underneath it, so\nthe notice depended on the menu''s guesses about focus and clicks. The\nData menu now owns the notice, like the summary panel and the floating\ntoolbar button do; the row closes the menu and the action runs from\nthere.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc72f0e267cec7f0c70acf649294381e2276ba0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/dc72f0e267cec7f0c70acf649294381e2276ba0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/795863405c3d0b74c58b12b33ce0a3efed91cfde","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/795863405c3d0b74c58b12b33ce0a3efed91cfde","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDc5NTg2MzQwNWMzZDBiNzRjNThiMTJiMzNjZTBhM2VmZWQ5MWNmZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/1971d508a336221b6308dc078a533723a47ce04c","sha":"1971d508a336221b6308dc078a533723a47ce04c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/1971d508a336221b6308dc078a533723a47ce04c"}],"sha":"795863405c3d0b74c58b12b33ce0a3efed91cfde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/795863405c3d0b74c58b12b33ce0a3efed91cfde"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/1971d508a336221b6308dc078a533723a47ce04c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:24:30Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:24:30Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"refactor(DataMenu): own the Export Network to Image dialog (#784)\n\nThe row rendered the dialog itself, so the dialog lived only as long as\nthe Data menu stayed open, and the menu had to guess from focus and\nclick events whether the dialog still belonged to it. A Select opened\nand dismissed without choosing still made it guess wrong and unmount\nthe dialog.\n\nThe Data menu now owns the dialog, lazy-loaded behind a mount latch;\nthe row only closes the menu and opens it. The lazy wrapper around the\nrow (DynamicExportImageMenuItem) is gone.\n\nExportImage re-keys itself on every open, so its file name follows the\nnetwork current at that moment. That also fixes the summary panel''s\nnetwork menu, which keeps the dialog mounted and showed the first\nnetwork''s name on later opens.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f12688b68ce1cb03dab3cb1bf34fce1bb09cb74a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/f12688b68ce1cb03dab3cb1bf34fce1bb09cb74a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/1971d508a336221b6308dc078a533723a47ce04c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/1971d508a336221b6308dc078a533723a47ce04c","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDE5NzFkNTA4YTMzNjIyMWI2MzA4ZGMwNzhhNTMzNzIzYTQ3Y2UwNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/258992528157380e40e65669180ece71275c7f60","sha":"258992528157380e40e65669180ece71275c7f60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/258992528157380e40e65669180ece71275c7f60"}],"sha":"1971d508a336221b6308dc078a533723a47ce04c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/1971d508a336221b6308dc078a533723a47ce04c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/258992528157380e40e65669180ece71275c7f60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T00:03:27Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T00:03:27Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"fix(DropdownMenu): decide click-away on mousedown (#784)\n\nOpening a Select in a dialog owned by a menu row (Data > Export >\nNetwork to Image > File Type) still closed the menu and unmounted the\ndialog. MUI''s Select opens its option list over the field on mousedown,\nso the mouseup lands on the list and the browser fires the click on the\nnearest common ancestor, body. That is outside the menu''s React tree,\nand ClickAwayListener (click by default) closed the menu.\n\nDecide on mousedown, where the user pressed. Ignore a press on the\nmenu''s own trigger: its click handler toggles the menu, and closing on\nmousedown would let that click reopen it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c1c891d0b73db40b2655197f6b5db051e5b3e8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/0c1c891d0b73db40b2655197f6b5db051e5b3e8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/258992528157380e40e65669180ece71275c7f60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/258992528157380e40e65669180ece71275c7f60","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDI1ODk5MjUyODE1NzM4MGU0MGU2NTY2OTE4MGVjZTcxMjc1YzdmNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/7c4b41d10ae441c3df2cf56930055c8cc2c6a6e7","sha":"7c4b41d10ae441c3df2cf56930055c8cc2c6a6e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/7c4b41d10ae441c3df2cf56930055c8cc2c6a6e7"}],"sha":"258992528157380e40e65669180ece71275c7f60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/258992528157380e40e65669180ece71275c7f60"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/7c4b41d10ae441c3df2cf56930055c8cc2c6a6e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:55:45Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T23:55:45Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"fix(DropdownMenu): decide focus-out in a task, not a microtask (#784)\n\nA menu row that owns its dialog (Data > Export > Network to Image, the\nNDEx save rows, Merge Networks, ...) closed the dialog on the first click\ninto any field, and on Confirm before the action could run.\n\nWhen a real click moves focus, the browser runs a microtask checkpoint\nbetween focusout and focusin. The blur check ran in that gap, saw\ndocument.activeElement === body and no onFocus from the dialog yet, and\nclosed the menu, which unmounted the dialog. Programmatic .focus() (the\nfocus trap, jsdom tests) fires both events before any microtask, which\nhid the bug.\n\nAdd a regression test that models the native event order, and let the\nMenuBar focus-out test wait a task.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2192d6995edfc9f9a0e6dd73224afa51bb5098d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/2192d6995edfc9f9a0e6dd73224afa51bb5098d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/7c4b41d10ae441c3df2cf56930055c8cc2c6a6e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified