ars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/64636dea6f535f52472f3112dcc069b61ca326bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:37:20Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:37:20Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"fix(useCenterAnchoredResize): reject a non-finite pan reference size (#778)\n\nsetPanReferenceSize accepted Infinity (only `> 0` was checked), and the\nfirst visible resize would then pan by an infinite delta. It now requires\nfinite, positive dimensions, like panForCanvasSize. New tests cover\nInfinity, NaN, zero and negative sizes set while hidden (only Infinity\nfailed before). Raised by CodeRabbit on #779.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"371c7dcc09df823e28962c7c570eb1d113cece76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/371c7dcc09df823e28962c7c570eb1d113cece76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/64636dea6f535f52472f3112dcc069b61ca326bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/64636dea6f535f52472f3112dcc069b61ca326bd","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDY0NjM2ZGVhNmY1MzVmNTI0NzJmMzExMmRjYzA2OWI2MWNhMzI2YmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/633d04361967ca973ac82266aab06a260440f547","sha":"633d04361967ca973ac82266aab06a260440f547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/633d04361967ca973ac82266aab06a260440f547"}],"sha":"64636dea6f535f52472f3112dcc069b61ca326bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/64636dea6f535f52472f3112dcc069b61ca326bd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/633d04361967ca973ac82266aab06a260440f547/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:36:20Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:36:20Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"fix(CyjsRenderer): never fit a destroyed Cytoscape instance (#778)\n\nCI failed the new #778 e2e test on Firefox and WebKit. Two causes:\n\n- App: an effect called cy.fit() on a destroyed instance. The `cy` state\n  can still hold an instance the mount effect''s cleanup already destroyed\n  (React StrictMode re-runs effects before setCy lands), and a destroyed\n  instance has no renderer: fit() -> boundingBox -> headless() threw\n  \"this._private.renderer is null\". An error thrown in an effect takes\n  down the renderer subtree, so the Tree View vanished mid-test (Firefox:\n  \"Tree View\" tab not found, camera never settling). The position effect\n  and renderNetwork now return early for a destroyed instance, and the\n  registered `fit` function checks again inside its deferred callback,\n  where a layout completing after a remount could reach a stale one.\n  Firefox logged the error without the guard, and neither browser does\n  with it.\n- Test: the fit step returned cy.fit()''s result, the whole Cytoscape\n  instance, which Playwright tried to serialize back; WebKit hung on it\n  until the test timed out. The callback now returns nothing.\n\nhierarchy-cell-view.spec.ts passes 2x on Chromium, Firefox and WebKit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbebea0c4cfca38eef600c074b2edf3d19b5c955","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/cbebea0c4cfca38eef600c074b2edf3d19b5c955"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/633d04361967ca973ac82266aab06a260440f547","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/633d04361967ca973ac82266aab06a260440f547","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDYzM2QwNDM2MTk2N2NhOTczYWM4MjI2NmFhYjA2YTI2MDQ0MGY1NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/bfdad622a25653bbcfe99c32a0302bd766f0bcc4","sha":"bfdad622a25653bbcfe99c32a0302bd766f0bcc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/bfdad622a25653bbcfe99c32a0302bd766f0bcc4"}],"sha":"633d04361967ca973ac82266aab06a260440f547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/633d04361967ca973ac82266aab06a260440f547"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2328291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d2fong","id":2328291,"login":"d2fong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjgyOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/08b23a625f8a85365854fd4956c545e0a12d474e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:25:06Z","email":"dylanfong.ut@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Fong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:25:06Z","email":"dylanfong.ut@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Fong"},"message":"docs(service-apps): limit the submenu merge rule to non-final entries (#722)\n\nThe menu-placement docs said any path entry whose name matches a built-in\nsubmenu merges into it. The last entry is the app''s own row, and\nappendServiceMenuItems never merges a row into a submenu, so the rule now\nnames only the entries before it.\n\nRaised by CodeRabbit on #780.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"497de4ac608960e16f194dbcd5d11c4c60d91305","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/497de4ac608960e16f194dbcd5d11c4c60d91305"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/08b23a625f8a85365854fd4956c545e0a12d474e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2328291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d2fong","id":2328291,"login":"d2fong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjgyOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/08b23a625f8a85365854fd4956c545e0a12d474e","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDA4YjIzYTYyNWY4YTg1MzY1ODU0ZmQ0OTU2YzU0NWUwYTEyZDQ3NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/8434e6c7bf70d875f9cb649a797348352211f591","sha":"8434e6c7bf70d875f9cb649a797348352211f591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/8434e6c7bf70d875f9cb649a797348352211f591"}],"sha":"08b23a625f8a85365854fd4956c545e0a12d474e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/08b23a625f8a85365854fd4956c545e0a12d474e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2328291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d2fong","id":2328291,"login":"d2fong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjgyOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/8434e6c7bf70d875f9cb649a797348352211f591/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:19:03Z","email":"dylanfong.ut@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Fong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T19:19:03Z","email":"dylanfong.ut@gmail.com","name":"Dylan Fong"},"message":"fix(menu): merge service-app paths into built-in submenus (#722)\n\nA service app with root Data and path Import > ... showed up in a second\n\"Import\" submenu at the bottom of the Data menu. Every host menu appended\nthe service-app items after a separator without looking at its own\nsubmenus, so a path that named a built-in submenu duplicated it.\n\nappendServiceMenuItems now merges a service submenu into the built-in\nsubmenu with the same label, recursively, and appends the rest after a\nseparator as before. The Data, Help, Edit and Analysis menus use it in\nplace of their inline append. Labels match exactly, the same rule\ncreateMenuItems uses when it merges app paths with each other. Tools, Layout\nand Apps are unchanged: they have no labelled built-in submenus to merge\ninto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98e8f5e1cc9a12d19eb98f34bc2cbd85fc7b86d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/98e8f5e1cc9a12d19eb98f34bc2cbd85fc7b86d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/8434e6c7bf70d875f9cb649a797348352211f591","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2328291?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d2fong","id":2328291,"login":"d2fong","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjgyOTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d2fong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/8434e6c7bf70d875f9cb649a797348352211f591","node_id":"C_kwDOIBoFTdoAKDg0MzRlNmM3YmY3MGQ4NzVmOWNiNjQ5YTc5NzM0ODM1MjIxMWY1OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commit/bb0aefd00016a764f822d328048e264f6b60e02e","sha":"bb0aefd00016a764f822d328048e264f6b60e02e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/bb0aefd00016a764f822d328048e264f6b60e02e"}],"sha":"8434e6c7bf70d875f9cb649a797348352211f591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/8434e6c7bf70d875f9cb649a797348352211f591"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4OTY4Ng==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/commits/bfdad622a25653bbcfe99c32a0302bd766f0bcc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T18:03:19Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T18:03:19Z","email":"chrtannus@gmail.com","name":"Christian Lopes"},"message":"fix(CyjsRenderer): keep the Tree View''s center across a hidden restore (#778)\n\nFit a hierarchy''s Tree View, show its Cell View, switch to a regular\nnetwork and back, then show the Tree View: it came back shifted (MuSIC:\ncenter (-419.8, -271.9) -> (-1303, -386)). Related to #749 (center-\nanchored resize, saved viewports recording their canvas size) and #753\n(the same kind of bug in the Cell View).\n\nComing back with the Cell View tab selected, the Tree View''s canvas is\nhidden (0 x 0) from the start, and its saved viewport is restored into\nit. panForCanvasSize cannot adjust a pan to 0 x 0, so the pan stayed\nrelative to the saved size (568 x 534, measured before the right panel\nreopened), and nothing recorded that. useCenterAnchoredResize only knew\nsizes the instance had seen while visible, which this one never was, so\nthe first show did not re-center it. A viewport saved while hidden was\nlikewise stored without a size.\n\nuseCenterAnchoredResize now tracks, per instance, the size the pan is\nrelative to:\n- panReferenceSize(cy): the cached size, or the last visible size while\n  hidden. The viewport save records it instead of dropping the size.\n- setPanReferenceSize(cy, size): declares it while hidden. The restore\n  passes the saved viewport''s size, so the first show shifts the pan by\n  half the difference, like any other resize.\n\nTests:\n- useCenterAnchoredResize.test.ts: the reference size when visible,\n  hidden, never visible, set while hidden (re-centers on first show) and\n  set while visible (ignored).\n- hierarchy-cell-view.spec.ts: the reproduction with the tree fixture and\n  a regular network, comparing the Tree View''s center and zoom. Failed\n  without the fix ((200, 200) -> (-106.2, 175.4)).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50d053e084744bee4bca35d0c99bfbb5dfecbe8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/trees/50d053e084744bee4bca35d0c99bfbb5dfecbe8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cytoscape/cytoscape-web/git/commits/bfdad622a25653bbcfe99c32a0302bd766f0bcc4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/989686?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrtannus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/chrtannus","id":989686,"login":"chrtannus","node_id