pos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/commits/1e4e775fc0ae6e2741f688c7deda1dac1595631a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:25:38Z","email":"hello@matteocollina.com","name":"Matteo Collina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:25:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(renovate): unstick dependency updates (#5162)\n\n* chore(renovate): unstick dependency updates\n\nRenovate only opened update PRs during weekend nights, at most one per\nhour, so it could not keep up with the ~110 pending updates on the\ndependency dashboard.\n\n- group all minor and patch updates into a single PR\n- run every night instead of weekend nights only\n- raise prHourlyLimit to 3 and cap open PRs with prConcurrentLimit 10\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KRUpWp9p188f98W7HE9tK3\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>\n\n* chore(renovate): ignore test fixture manifests\n\nconfig:recommended only ignores test/, tests/, __tests__/ and\n__fixtures__/, so the 187 package.json files under\npackages/runtime/fixtures were treated as real manifests. Their exact\npins (e.g. @platformatic/service 3.0.0) produced bogus update PRs for\npackages that live in this monorepo.\n\nSetting ignorePaths replaces the preset list, so the defaults are\nrepeated and **/fixtures/** is added.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KRUpWp9p188f98W7HE9tK3\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d413e55573ef817ff69b6fdddd2c146af55b16f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/git/trees/4d413e55573ef817ff69b6fdddd2c146af55b16f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/git/commits/1e4e775fc0ae6e2741f688c7deda1dac1595631a","verification":{"payload":"tree 4d413e55573ef817ff69b6fdddd2c146af55b16f\nparent afb3fdd23a6d5e22426bb80b9be8f5c15ddbe144\nauthor Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com> 1791300338 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791300338 -0700\n\nchore(renovate): unstick dependency updates (#5162)\n\n* chore(renovate): unstick dependency updates\n\nRenovate only opened update PRs during weekend nights, at most one per\nhour, so it could not keep up with the ~110 pending updates on the\ndependency dashboard.\n\n- group all minor and patch updates into a single PR\n- run every night instead of weekend nights only\n- raise prHourlyLimit to 3 and cap open PRs with prConcurrentLimit 10\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KRUpWp9p188f98W7HE9tK3\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>\n\n* chore(renovate): ignore test fixture manifests\n\nconfig:recommended only ignores test/, tests/, __tests__/ and\n__fixtures__/, so the 187 package.json files under\npackages/runtime/fixtures were treated as real manifests. Their exact\npins (e.g. @platformatic/service 3.0.0) produced bogus update PRs for\npackages that live in this monorepo.\n\nSetting ignorePaths replaces the preset list, so the defaults are\nrepeated and **/fixtures/** is added.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KRUpWp9p188f98W7HE9tK3\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxRLyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIHYQAKQLahm74uK5SV4j5yaapsZm\neY6Q5ZvaMVgI+k1jGANwiLBgQRxs44qwoeoKZQiMfFhVkEQM2ZMFIDm12BUlRRrc\ngM27o1yQH