rmatic/commits/eac0a278deeef5363d36fa109c74189fbfddb383/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:54:53Z","email":"hello@matteocollina.com","name":"Matteo Collina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:54:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(runtime): document scaleUpELU and scaleDownELU as configurable (#5123)\n\nThe reference page still described `verticalScaler.scaleUpELU` and\n`scaleDownELU` as deprecated, unused and hardcoded to 0.8 / 0.2. That\nwas true only between #4372, which turned them into module constants,\nand #4482, which restored them as options in both `verticalScaler` and\n`workers` at runtime and application level. #4482 did not touch the\ndocs.\n\nDocument the two thresholds under `workers`, restore their entries in\nthe `verticalScaler` section (including the per-application overrides),\nand list them in the per-application table of the dynamic workers\nguide. The time windows and scale interval remain fixed and stay marked\nas deprecated.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code:claude-fable-5-1\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019PBPXR7v8yJYVxzKZXAMtV\n\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8abb37d0ac97ed10d852ba91d8e2aac1ca20fa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/git/trees/f8abb37d0ac97ed10d852ba91d8e2aac1ca20fa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/git/commits/eac0a278deeef5363d36fa109c74189fbfddb383","verification":{"payload":"tree f8abb37d0ac97ed10d852ba91d8e2aac1ca20fa2\nparent 8f6b4e5ee2670d2148655d34235561ee6191248f\nauthor Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com> 1791107693 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791107693 +0200\n\ndocs(runtime): document scaleUpELU and scaleDownELU as configurable (#5123)\n\nThe reference page still described `verticalScaler.scaleUpELU` and\n`scaleDownELU` as deprecated, unused and hardcoded to 0.8 / 0.2. That\nwas true only between #4372, which turned them into module constants,\nand #4482, which restored them as options in both `verticalScaler` and\n`workers` at runtime and application level. #4482 did not touch the\ndocs.\n\nDocument the two thresholds under `workers`, restore their entries in\nthe `verticalScaler` section (including the per-application overrides),\nand list them in the per-application table of the dynamic workers\nguide. The time windows and scale interval remain fixed and stay marked\nas deprecated.\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code:claude-fable-5-1\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019PBPXR7v8yJYVxzKZXAMtV\n\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwiJtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlUIQACKjHNlPwpBvbV7AJkkDuAi/\nm612YyRwVQanfKcsdkKIKPk/N69qsDGR5PCvFHdSmmZ0R1j03WsLDm0s7Ph3vRwT\ntsQPztGHcHlz1JrYfy5kkjbrCU0h0DKUP2iw8GJAiKCoZfhOrVmKu6xajmRVxqaa\nvNjLx86X1q6duodzn6b+2OqU2z7b/mMHYs7BivIdGkQfLx4/Ujj3Qjj8Cq6MBDal\nH+hNCZ/ONYceK5q3g2DnwLxPtylo7XNEq5rSMZfT3RzOnxlzL9ZW/v2KnonJIEjV\n0KM9iiRpXMactShM2M6rSAq4tf4fiG5F3B+cbeyeorRI9/rnY8WtJkfqoBkX1nFT\nVQzy3CSsL4JSKhkTlvhDw4CbLguX2VgRu8kkJ9DKZVxrOEKj7le1RjdMbBBjkJch\ntEUnv+45Awakkb8crNbjSuLLUcIEze4ej8fPF48hEDoCmIIOFkG0PofoC2698khU\nSDzt8ytdAYy/9jDhvZbx3iZ6k9vyLMiJqd4aOJeGXWYbTr2hmGPK6gi1YnB8Cis3\nX7a1gM3M0M3sDhOekG1KNeGvtBFSFMSjmV+OmqVeWadgvNYTbWN9vzJio962tt0t\nL2gNs7y04KTxLHqsHkBWoR0Q6tsPuKNsEu+Gios3KMKbXVmt8AMOPm3rMmbAejw8\nQVyzq90IQMIHDejawyLX\n=29N0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T09:54:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,