its/e2a905e9c671093fa80b605d18c98873d32ce0bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52195?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mcollina","id":52195,"login":"mcollina","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMTk1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcollina","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/commits/8a45b42453bf08eadbafa6abb4e95894b1cde804/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T11:28:40Z","email":"hello@matteocollina.com","name":"Matteo Collina"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T11:28:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(nuxt): report real dev server URL via Nuxt ready event (#5064)\n\nFix the flaky ''supports https server options in development mode'' test.\nNuxt 4''s dev CLI probes a random port with a throwaway net.Server (via\nlisthen/get-port-please) before the real server listens. The generic URL\ncapture in child-process.js subscribes to the FIRST net.server.listen trace\nand therefore reports the probe''s URL, which races the real server''s startup\nand intermittently fails with ECONNREFUSED.\n\nA new nuxt dev-ready child script opts the spawned ''nuxt.mjs dev'' into\nNuxt''s own dev IPC so the CLI reports its real ready address (after the\nbuild, when the serving server is up), and forwards that URL to the parent\nvia the child-manager ''url'' event. The basic capability exposes a generic\nurlFromScript option on startWithCommand/ChildManager that tells\nchild-process.js to skip the tracing-channel URL and rely on a script, so\nno Nuxt-specific behavior lives in the basic package. The spawn uses\n--no-fork to avoid Nuxt''s warm-fork pool competing for the port.\n\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e5d47df3a33ea8e9e051b81b0ae74191831dd28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/git/trees/8e5d47df3a33ea8e9e051b81b0ae74191831dd28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/git/commits/8a45b42453bf08eadbafa6abb4e95894b1cde804","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e5d47df3a33ea8e9e051b81b0ae74191831dd28\nparent d5fca495133a5adfccca57108cca464359af54e7\nauthor Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com> 1786102120 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786102120 +0100\n\nfix(nuxt): report real dev server URL via Nuxt ready event (#5064)\n\nFix the flaky ''supports https server options in development mode'' test.\nNuxt 4''s dev CLI probes a random port with a throwaway net.Server (via\nlisthen/get-port-please) before the real server listens. The generic URL\ncapture in child-process.js subscribes to the FIRST net.server.listen trace\nand therefore reports the probe''s URL, which races the real server''s startup\nand intermittently fails with ECONNREFUSED.\n\nA new nuxt dev-ready child script opts the spawned ''nuxt.mjs dev'' into\nNuxt''s own dev IPC so the CLI reports its real ready address (after the\nbuild, when the serving server is up), and forwards that URL to the parent\nvia the child-manager ''url'' event. The basic capability exposes a generic\nurlFromScript option on startWithCommand/ChildManager that tells\nchild-process.js to skip the tracing-channel URL and rely on a script, so\nno Nuxt-specific behavior lives in the basic package. The spawn uses\n--no-fork to avoid Nuxt''s warm-fork pool competing for the port.\n\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdcFoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAArewQAHEDHisYQENOWxstYgm+SlhM\nCIWnplb0J7QvWllYpAJO/wlt2dhBe1f5arAPSPAgqCg/VFYMehOzpWU10043s0Ad\n9DKha5GGiF3CthLSVf44Y0UnMRCY66VdZGg5shrMKng1ZMCYc8g5W1Mnrw/IVftN\nmnfBO2VTYPDa3rVAJL7mB6FMHDlDYH76SkZZN36xFJNskYHsTEJPSUl9IbIdiZdr\nL17cUbcRNPKOvaEYqIs4C2qPPjDO3G2LcOGD6Tolktv+YQb/ccKJzApX1gUu4v64\nIuIkCHw7FKibY5AxrvbgW45arh8l1QEjShH+CPREwmxC5+J2at5o2EWgWABZ38gQ\nNkRgm5YNem2+flWAt2b/KZ4MgQA8kI5PH7W2UkLbKrIzoaIxfHg6XKGf5q7KLEss\n4nBMvYmfvvgHqRk05jKtt8F8Zaij0Hjp7WlGeRllJUinPdfC975KcNRs7jhh9oGd\nDLWr0cbb48h4qscFCvUW8ejWgWjGgMp5KDDfpVkFeL23aes1uYrkPx9R9tjLEAIq\nfFohXDdz8lsB2zyGqUpn+f7+sRh8FwFGfFPFBrVPQ5cZwozTd1RYEkHLEURl395h\nJxx6WVdMXM5Rddf359VgcxR60Camh+7cWX6mc8hCioggtiXhT3cVOJE/i5njUk5C\nNcZlVMcSpOAuI1Z61NOG\n=KufH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-07T11:28:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/platformatic/platformatic/commit/8a45b42453bf08eadbafa6abb4e95894b1cde804","node_id":"C_kwDOIC2I7NoAKDhhNDViNDI0NTNiZjA4ZWFkYmFmYTZhYmI0ZTk1ODk0YjFjZGU4MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/platformatic/platformatic/commit/d5fca495133a5adfccca57108cca464359af54e7","sha":"d5fca495133a5adfccca57108cca464359af54e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/commits/d5fca495133a5adfccca57108cca464359af54e7"}],"sha":"8a45b42453bf08eadbafa6abb4e95894b1cde804","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/commits/8a45b42453bf08eadbafa6abb4e95894b1cde804"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2728023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akallabet/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akallabet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akallabet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akallabet/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Akallabet","id":2728023,"login":"Akallabet","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MjgwMjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akallabet/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akallabet/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akallabet/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akallabet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akallabet/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Akallabet","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/commits/d5fca495133a5adfccca57108cca464359af54e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:22:32Z","email":"grazianos86@gmail.com","name":"Graziano Statello"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T12:22:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(gateway): pin @platformatic/foundation to the exact workspace version (#5063)\n\n* fix(gateway): pin @platformatic/foundation to the exact workspace version\n\n`packages/gateway` is the only package in the monorepo that declares a\nworkspace dependency as `workspace:^` rather than `workspace:*`. pnpm\nexpands `workspace:^` to `^<version>` at publish time, so every published\n`@platformatic/gateway` accepts any newer 3.x `@platformatic/foundation`,\nwhile all 28 other packages that depend on foundation pin it exactly.\n\nFor consumers who pin Platformatic to a release older than `latest`, that\nasymmetry installs two copies of `@platformatic/foundation` — gateway\nfloats to the newest published version, its siblings stay on the pinned\none. Since foundation holds shared runtime symbols, the duplicate breaks\nthe gateway/service boundary at startup.\n\nChanging the specifier to `workspace:*` makes gateway match every other\npackage and publishes an exact pin.\n\nSigned-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Akallabet <grazianos86@gmail.com>\n\n* chore: regenerate pnpm lockfile\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code:claude-sonnet-5\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Akallabet <grazianos86@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>","tree":{"sha":"d38a6c7bf0f8d4733479a3145bef6d22cdfd1b83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/git/trees/d38a6c7bf0f8d4733479a3145bef6d22cdfd1b83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/platformatic/platformatic/git/commits/d5fca495133a5adfccca57108cca464359af54e7","verification":{"payload":"tree d38a6c7bf0f8d4733479a3145bef6d22cdfd1b83\nparent e11df9278be6cdcbfca7ed82dacb7c649b049242\nauthor Graziano Statello <grazianos86@gmail.com> 1786018952 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786018952 +0100\n\nfix(gateway): pin @platformatic/foundation to the exact workspace version (#5063)\n\n* fix(gateway): pin @platformatic/foundation to the exact workspace version\n\n`packages/gateway` is the only package in the monorepo that declares a\nworkspace dependency as `workspace:^` rather than `workspace:*`. pnpm\nexpands `workspace:^` to `^<version>` at publish time, so every published\n`@platformatic/gateway` accepts any newer 3.x `@platformatic/foundation`,\nwhile all 28 other packages that depend on foundation pin it exactly.\n\nFor consumers who pin Platformatic to a release older than `latest`, that\nasymmetry installs two copies of `@platformatic/foundation` — gateway\nfloats to the newest published version, its siblings stay on the pinned\none. Since foundation holds shared runtime symbols, the duplicate breaks\nthe gateway/service boundary at startup.\n\nChanging the specifier to `workspace:*` makes gateway match every other\npackage and publishes an exact pin.\n\nSigned-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Akallabet <grazianos86@gmail.com>\n\n* chore: regenerate pnpm lockfile\n\nAssisted-by: Claude Code:claude-sonnet-5\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Akallabet <grazianos86@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Matteo Collina <hello@matteocollina.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdHyJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVEIQAJF04tvXlVgT0I5+iZWe9UN3\nwhneWH9BeM0J7tzb6uZSA0EiMTQXumlR7K8pQgZjf+zGrl1ymlDva/0qtiXnVFdc\nAkT0+sU5t5YQv1XLrrE64teaOjiwTtYqcGD3p0nqxh1QfykERtRGN+Z+clab4qXW\nUzk/jMsPxSn7sk+bjN/2JOuWR5nkwn7+G7pukyy6y7yIvgdLDZ7qkoeVNZ3d+k/f\nk6Qv/0EXldPksC076kdJSLsT+KtFkSfAr4PrS/HGYD+K8207q